('89745724-8904-5804-932a-893683d2cf8c','cb8a359d-2a55-588a-a99c-ce96bb434f26',5,null,null,'old-fashioned','tuberculosis',null,null,'سل','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['high/low People should stop using expensive cars with a high petrol consumption.','total consumption Total consumption of petrol has risen by 20%.','domestic consumption (= use of something in the country where it is produced ) Domestic consumption of oil has increased.','household consumption (= use in the home ) The government is encouraging us to reduce our household consumption of water.','energy consumption Over a quarter of our energy consumption is in the home.','fuel/electricity/gas consumption There are three possible methods of reducing oil consumption.','reduce consumption The system will be introduced into all stores to reduce energy consumption by up to 10%','cut consumption (= reduce it ) a plan to cut energy consumption by 40%','consumption rises/increases/goes up Consumption of unleaded fuel rose by 17% in 1992.','consumption falls/decreases/goes down Coal consumption has fallen dramatically.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('4855ab02-4e94-50ec-835f-7ca08430a27e','6e5b3994-7874-5a85-af2c-9ea1e3d434c4',1,null,null,'spoken & written','when you work with someone to achieve something that you both want',null,null,'همکاری، هم‌کاری؛ همدلی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['international/European cooperation What are the benefits of greater European cooperation?','military/political etc cooperation The association deals with trade and economic cooperation.','close cooperation We work together in close cooperation to provide the best possible service.','mutual cooperation (= between two people, groups etc ) Because of the size of the task, mutual cooperation was essential.','active cooperation There is active cooperation between the two schools.','effective cooperation The inspectors criticized a lack of effective cooperation among the staff.','need cooperation Schools need the cooperation of parents.','require cooperation formal: Management of these problems requires cooperation.','encourage/promote cooperation (= make people want to work together ) The programme will promote cooperation between universities and industry.','a lack of cooperation the lack of cooperation between the two countries','a need for cooperation There is a need for closer cooperation between the departments.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"political co-operation with Britain","translation":"همکاری سیاسی با بریتانیا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686174.mp3"},{"sentence":"A study was undertaken in co-operation with oil companies.","translation":"مطالعه ای با همکاری شرکت های نفتی انجام شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000863351.mp3"},{"sentence":"Burglar alarm companies claim they work in close co-operation with the police.","translation":"شرکت های اعلام سرقت ادعا می کنند که در همکاری نزدیک با پلیس کار می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686177.mp3"},{"sentence":"the lack of effective co-operation between industry and higher education","translation":"فقدان همکاری مؤثر بین صنعت و آموزش عالی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000863348.mp3"},{"sentence":"the need to strengthen international co-operation","translation":"نیاز به تقویت همکاری های بین المللی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686181.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('cf7d5abf-6875-548d-9362-6cbf150fb772','6e5b3994-7874-5a85-af2c-9ea1e3d434c4',2,null,null,'spoken & written','willingness to do what someone asks you to do',null,null,'تمایل به انجام کاری که کسی از شما می خواهد انجام دهید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['international/European cooperation What are the benefits of greater European cooperation?','military/political etc cooperation The association deals with trade and economic cooperation.','close cooperation We work together in close cooperation to provide the best possible service.','mutual cooperation (= between two people, groups etc ) Because of the size of the task, mutual cooperation was essential.','active cooperation There is active cooperation between the two schools.','effective cooperation The inspectors criticized a lack of effective cooperation among the staff.','need cooperation Schools need the cooperation of parents.','require cooperation formal: Management of these problems requires cooperation.','encourage/promote cooperation (= make people want to work together ) The programme will promote cooperation between universities and industry.','a lack of cooperation the lack of cooperation between the two countries','a need for cooperation There is a need for closer cooperation between the departments.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Have your passports ready, and thank you for your cooperation.","translation":"پاسپورت های خود را آماده داشته باشید و از همکاری شما سپاسگزاریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000863355.mp3"},{"sentence":"Your full cooperation is requested.","translation":"همکاری کامل شما درخواست می شود","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686184.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('d6e35adf-d88e-5b48-98d7-68a116fa9951','f6e4b203-821b-5959-8526-1b97aa22e363',1,null,null,'spoken & written','land that is outside cities and towns',null,null,'حومه، خارج از شهر؛ ییلاق',array['the country']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['beautiful/stunning The countryside between the Alpine villages is stunning.','open countryside (= with few buildings, walls, trees etc ) The farmhouse has views over open countryside.','the surrounding countryside Both the town and the surrounding countryside are worth exploring.','rolling countryside (= with hills ) a valley surrounded by rolling countryside','green countryside Our train was passing through rolling green countryside.','unspoilt countryside (= not changed or not having a lot of new buildings ) This area is ideal for a weekend break in unspoilt countryside.','rugged countryside (= rough and uneven ) Uzbekistan is an area known for its rugged countryside and tough people.','protect/conserve the countryside (= stop people building on it or spoiling its beauty ) How can we protect the countryside for future generations?','spoil/ruin the countryside Too many tourists can spoil the countryside.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The house had lovely views over open countryside .","translation":"خانه دارای منظره دوست داشتنی از حومه شهر باز بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000842818.mp3"},{"sentence":"people who live in the countryside","translation":"افرادی که در روستا زندگی می کنند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001682032.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('b9749fb8-e26b-5d0a-a8a3-1304a86804de','36b89876-4107-57a2-8af4-b1373267558a',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a small plastic card that you use to buy goods or services and pay for them later',null,null,'کارت اعتباری، کارت بانکی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We accept all major credit cards.","translation":"ما تمام کارت های اعتباری اصلی را می پذیریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000845533.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('243bf8fd-6ec4-5a17-bc92-6020c5574365','8bf09453-4930-582a-a887-840aa2a2256d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to show or prove something clearly','[ transitive ]',null,'نشان دادن، اثبات کردن؛ تظاهرات راه‌انداختن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The study demonstrates the link between poverty and malnutrition.","translation":"این مطالعه ارتباط بین فقر و سوء تغذیه را نشان می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000816692.mp3"},{"sentence":"Hitchcock’s films demonstrate that a British filmmaker could learn from Hollywood.","translation":"فیلم های هیچکاک نشان می دهد که یک فیلمساز بریتانیایی می تواند از هالیوود بیاموزد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000816695.mp3"},{"sentence":"This section will attempt to demonstrate how the Bank of England operates.","translation":"این بخش سعی خواهد کرد نحوه عملکرد بانک انگلستان را نشان دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747841.mp3"},{"sentence":"The government now has an opportunity to demonstrate its commitment to reform.","translation":"دولت اکنون فرصتی برای نشان دادن تعهد خود به اصلاحات دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001830424.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('2dbb9f3e-8cea-5594-a42e-6b9bbe13f9b2','8bf09453-4930-582a-a887-840aa2a2256d',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to show or describe how to do something or how something works','[ transitive ]',null,'برای نشان دادن یا توصیف نحوه انجام کاری یا نحوه کار کردن چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"They’ll be demonstrating how to handle modern, high performance cars.","translation":"آنها نشان خواهند داد که چگونه می توان با خودروهای مدرن و با کارایی بالا کار کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747844.mp3"},{"sentence":"Instructors should demonstrate new movements before letting the class try them.","translation":"مربیان باید قبل از اجازه دادن به کلاس حرکات جدید را نشان دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747845.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('4db3fcf1-1212-52ea-a633-10bbc219e398','8bf09453-4930-582a-a887-840aa2a2256d',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to protest or support something in public with a lot of other people','[ intransitive ]',null,'اعتراض یا حمایت از چیزی در ملاء عام با افراد زیادی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Supporters demonstrated outside the courtroom during the trial.","translation":"حامیان در طول دادگاه بیرون از دادگاه تظاهرات کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000816704.mp3"},{"sentence":"What are they demonstrating against?","translation":"آنها علیه چه چیزی تظاهرات می کنند؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000816707.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('e6700f36-3719-5ad8-bfca-de8d0e64a2fe','8bf09453-4930-582a-a887-840aa2a2256d',4,null,null,'spoken & written','to show that you have a particular ability , quality , or feeling','[ transitive ]',null,'نشان دهید که توانایی، کیفیت یا احساس خاصی دارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He has demonstrated an ability to meet deadlines.","translation":"او توانایی خود را در رعایت ضرب الاجل نشان داده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747848.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('e516b4d3-b2db-5cb8-866c-e49bfb990b35','c620ee7f-b663-5d99-ae03-f2f2327bb70c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a piece of writing or speech that gives details about what someone or something is like',null,'job description','توصیف، شرح؛ گونه، نوع','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give (somebody) a description She was unable to give the police a description of her attacker.','provide a description formal The diary provides a clear description of farming life in the 1850s.','issue a description (= formally give a description of someone to the public ) Police have issued a description of the two men they are looking for.','fit/match a description (= be like the person in a police description ) The first man they arrested did not fit the description given by the victim.','somebody answering a description (= a person who looks like someone in a police description ) A young girl answering this description has been seen in Spain.','good Her descriptions of the natural world are very good.','clear He gave us a clear description of the situation in the city.','detailed Some of his descriptions of the island are very detailed.','accurate I don''t think the hotel''s description of its facilities was very accurate.','vivid (= very clear and interesting ) The book contains some vivid descriptions of his childhood.','perfect We have a perfect description of the man we are looking for.','a full description formal (= detailed ) Please give a full description of your responsibilities in your present job.','a long/lengthy description I didn''t want to hear a lengthy description of their holiday.','a brief/short description There''s only a brief description of the hotel on the Internet.','a general description (= not detailed ) He started by giving us a general description of the manufacturing process.','a graphic description (= very clear and containing a lot of details, usually about something unpleasant ) The book has some graphic descriptions of life in the prison camp.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"an accurate description of the event","translation":"شرح دقیق رویداد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001715991.mp3"},{"sentence":"The booklet gives a brief description of each place.","translation":"کتابچه توضیح مختصری در مورد هر مکان می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001830482.mp3"},{"sentence":"Berlin sounds fascinating from your description.","translation":"برلین از توضیحات شما جذاب به نظر می رسد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000818333.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('2f05ebf4-c6be-5d51-ad59-fbe358b9cc5e','c620ee7f-b663-5d99-ae03-f2f2327bb70c',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be beyond/past description','توصیف، شرح؛ گونه، نوع','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give (somebody) a description She was unable to give the police a description of her attacker.','provide a description formal The diary provides a clear description of farming life in the 1850s.','issue a description (= formally give a description of someone to the public ) Police have issued a description of the two men they are looking for.','fit/match a description (= be like the person in a police description ) The first man they arrested did not fit the description given by the victim.','somebody answering a description (= a person who looks like someone in a police description ) A young girl answering this description has been seen in Spain.','good Her descriptions of the natural world are very good.','clear He gave us a clear description of the situation in the city.','detailed Some of his descriptions of the island are very detailed.','accurate I don''t think the hotel''s description of its facilities was very accurate.','vivid (= very clear and interesting ) The book contains some vivid descriptions of his childhood.','perfect We have a perfect description of the man we are looking for.','a full description formal (= detailed ) Please give a full description of your responsibilities in your present job.','a long/lengthy description I didn''t want to hear a lengthy description of their holiday.','a brief/short description There''s only a brief description of the hotel on the Internet.','a general description (= not detailed ) He started by giving us a general description of the manufacturing process.','a graphic description (= very clear and containing a lot of details, usually about something unpleasant ) The book has some graphic descriptions of life in the prison camp.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('0ad06224-b5cf-5af1-9086-bf5b8875c165','c620ee7f-b663-5d99-ae03-f2f2327bb70c',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'of every/some/any etc description','توصیف، شرح؛ گونه، نوع','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give (somebody) a description She was unable to give the police a description of her attacker.','provide a description formal The diary provides a clear description of farming life in the 1850s.','issue a description (= formally give a description of someone to the public ) Police have issued a description of the two men they are looking for.','fit/match a description (= be like the person in a police description ) The first man they arrested did not fit the description given by the victim.','somebody answering a description (= a person who looks like someone in a police description ) A young girl answering this description has been seen in Spain.','good Her descriptions of the natural world are very good.','clear He gave us a clear description of the situation in the city.','detailed Some of his descriptions of the island are very detailed.','accurate I don''t think the hotel''s description of its facilities was very accurate.','vivid (= very clear and interesting ) The book contains some vivid descriptions of his childhood.','perfect We have a perfect description of the man we are looking for.','a full description formal (= detailed ) Please give a full description of your responsibilities in your present job.','a long/lengthy description I didn''t want to hear a lengthy description of their holiday.','a brief/short description There''s only a brief description of the hotel on the Internet.','a general description (= not detailed ) He started by giving us a general description of the manufacturing process.','a graphic description (= very clear and containing a lot of details, usually about something unpleasant ) The book has some graphic descriptions of life in the prison camp.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('561a1964-3f04-517a-bc74-73f87ee5a7bf','63ce05fd-499a-51cc-a4a0-ac6e7672964d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the act or process of destroying something or of being destroyed',null,null,'نابودی، ویرانی؛ تخریب','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['total/complete destruction In a populated area, a wave that high would cause total destruction.','wholesale destruction formal (= total ) It was an act of war, the wholesale destruction of a city.','wanton destruction (= done deliberately and without caring about it ) People were shocked by the wanton destruction that occurred during the riots.','environmental destruction The islands are already threatened by environmental destruction.','forest/rainforest destruction a Brazilian report on rainforest destruction','habitat destruction (= of the natural homes of plants and animals ) Habitat destruction has reduced elephant herds in central Africa.','widespread destruction The rains caused widespread destruction to crops.','great/massive destruction Much of the city was rebuilt after the massive destruction of World War II.','ozone destruction Ozone destruction is most severe over the Antarctic due to climatic and atmospheric extremes.','cause/lead to/bring about destruction It''s clear that the bomb was intended to cause death and destruction.','wreak destruction formal (= cause destruction ) The destruction wrought by the hurricane left thousands of people homeless.','weapons of mass destruction (= weapons intended to cause a lot of death and destruction ) The country is believed to have the potential to develop weapons of mass destruction.','a trail of destruction (= a long line of things that have been destroyed ) The accident, involving five vehicles, caused a trail of destruction on the motorway.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the destruction of the rainforest","translation":"نابودی جنگل های بارانی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000471738.mp3"},{"sentence":"weapons of mass destruction","translation":"سلاح های کشتار جمعی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001752311.mp3"},{"sentence":"the environmental destruction caused by the road building programme","translation":"تخریب محیط زیست ناشی از برنامه راهسازی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001830535.mp3"},{"sentence":"The floods brought death and destruction to the area.","translation":"سیل باعث مرگ و ویرانی این منطقه شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716521.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('4eb12c18-0df9-5ca0-a968-06685013f2b6','207a3d01-2b32-56eb-9ef8-c539bc9d2129',1,'growth','رشد','spoken & written','the process of gradually becoming bigger, better, stronger, or more advanced','[ uncountable ]',null,'توسعه، پیشرفت؛ رشد؛ مسکن (ساختمان‌سازی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"child development","translation":"رشد کودک","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000821856.mp3"},{"sentence":"a course on the development of Greek thought","translation":"دوره ای در مورد توسعه اندیشه یونانی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000821859.mp3"},{"sentence":"opportunities for professional development","translation":"فرصت هایی برای توسعه حرفه ای","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743427.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('e01f80d9-edad-5abc-9e1f-487e8e87a3dc','207a3d01-2b32-56eb-9ef8-c539bc9d2129',2,'economic activity','فعالیت اقتصادی','spoken & written','the process of increasing business, trade, and industrial activity','[ uncountable ]',null,'روند افزایش فعالیت های تجاری، تجاری و صنعتی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['economic/industrial/business etc development The US has been keen to encourage economic development in Egypt.','regional development (= development of particular regions of a country or area ) a programme of regional development in Eastern Europe','sustainable development (= that is able to continue without damaging the environment ) The government is committed to sustainable development and the protection of the environment.','overseas development (= in other countries, especially poor ones ) The Overseas Development Minister announced a £7,000,000 emergency aid programme for Somalia.','support/assist development ( also further/facilitate development formal ) We need to facilitate development and economic activity that provides jobs.','a development programme/plan/project the United Nations Development Programme','a development agency (= organization that aims to help development in poor areas ) international development agencies','development work (= the work of helping development in poor areas ) Further funds are required to allow the development work to continue.','development aid (= money given to help development in poor areas ) Education made up 22.5 percent of development aid last year.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"economic development in Russia","translation":"توسعه اقتصادی در روسیه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743434.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
