('8531a034-88b4-5345-b2d8-3aaaea4f18bf','d91acb87-39df-52ce-b0a6-b4f7584dac46',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a large organization that has a particular kind of work or purpose','[ countable ]',null,'مؤسسه، نهاد؛ بنیاد (مذهبی)؛ عادت (نهادینه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the government and other political institutions","translation":"دولت و سایر نهادهای سیاسی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001798336.mp3"},{"sentence":"powerful institutions such as world banks","translation":"موسسات قدرتمندی مانند بانک های جهانی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001417200.mp3"},{"sentence":"the Institution of Electrical Engineers","translation":"موسسه مهندسین برق","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001798337.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('253cef7e-871d-50ec-91ab-08ca93ceb1a5','d91acb87-39df-52ce-b0a6-b4f7584dac46',2,null,null,'spoken & written','an important system of organization in society that has existed for a long time','[ countable ]',null,'یک سیستم مهم سازماندهی در جامعه که برای مدت طولانی وجود داشته است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"social institutions such as the family and religion","translation":"نهادهای اجتماعی مانند خانواده و مذهب","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001798339.mp3"},{"sentence":"The scandal threatened to undermine the institution of the presidency.","translation":"این رسوایی تهدیدی برای تضعیف نهاد ریاست جمهوری بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001798344.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('a4d8eadd-c5a5-5b47-91b1-1d9ebc6dfa65','d91acb87-39df-52ce-b0a6-b4f7584dac46',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a building that people are sent to when they need to be looked after, for example old people or children with no parents – often used to show disapproval','[ countable ]',null,'ساختمانی که افراد در زمانی که نیاز به مراقبت دارند به آن فرستاده می‌شوند، برای مثال افراد مسن یا کودکان بدون پدر و مادر - اغلب برای نشان دادن مخالفت استفاده می‌شود.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I was determined not to put my mother in an institution.","translation":"مصمم بودم مادرم را در موسسه نگذارم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001798347.mp3"},{"sentence":"a mental institution (= for the mentally ill )","translation":"یک موسسه روانی (= برای بیماران روانی)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001798348.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('48d97df5-df4e-594b-b43b-c72645cb411f','d91acb87-39df-52ce-b0a6-b4f7584dac46',4,null,null,'spoken & written','when something is started or introduced , especially something relating to the law or politics','[ uncountable ]',null,'هنگامی که چیزی شروع یا معرفی می شود، به ویژه چیزی که مربوط به قانون یا سیاست است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the institution of divorce proceedings","translation":"تشکیل دادرسی طلاق","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001417227.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('1ce251d4-79e2-5aff-9f09-946d1922101b','d91acb87-39df-52ce-b0a6-b4f7584dac46',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be an institution','مؤسسه، نهاد؛ بنیاد (مذهبی)؛ عادت (نهادینه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('f5156552-542e-5208-b7c5-79b6ce923b4c','ff5da935-c1da-520a-abcd-0071c666603d',1,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'instructions','دستور، دستورالعمل؛ آموزش، تعلیم','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['follow the instructions (= do what the instructions tell you to do ) You should follow the instructions on the packet.','read the instructions Always read the instructions before switching on the machine.','provide/supply instructions (= give someone instructions ) Detailed instructions are supplied with the software.','come with instructions The tent comes with instructions on how to put it up.','the instructions say/tell you to do something The instructions say that you should take the tablets after meals.','clear The instructions that I got with the phone weren’t very clear.','detailed There are detailed instructions on the back of the box.','written instructions Each member of the team was issued with written instructions.','full/comprehensive instructions (= very detailed ) There are comprehensive instructions for completing and filing the new tax form. Full instructions accompany the smoke alarm.','step-by-step instructions (= giving details of each thing you should do in order ) This book gives step-by-step instructions for making curtains.','the manufacturer’s instructions (= the instructions given by the company that made something ) Make up the mixture according to the manufacturer’s instructions.','safety instructions Written safety instructions should be supplied with all equipment.','operating instructions The operating instructions have been simplified so that they are easier to follow.','cooking instructions The cooking instructions can be found on the side of the packet.','an instruction book/manual The instruction manual for the camera is over 150 pages long.','an instruction booklet/leaflet/sheet The washing machine comes with an instruction leaflet.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('85080424-066d-5469-9926-7663b253a8fb','ff5da935-c1da-520a-abcd-0071c666603d',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a statement telling someone what they must do','[ countable usually plural ]',null,'بیانیه ای که به کسی می گوید که چه کاری باید انجام دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['follow the instructions (= do what the instructions tell you to do ) You should follow the instructions on the packet.','read the instructions Always read the instructions before switching on the machine.','provide/supply instructions (= give someone instructions ) Detailed instructions are supplied with the software.','come with instructions The tent comes with instructions on how to put it up.','the instructions say/tell you to do something The instructions say that you should take the tablets after meals.','clear The instructions that I got with the phone weren’t very clear.','detailed There are detailed instructions on the back of the box.','written instructions Each member of the team was issued with written instructions.','full/comprehensive instructions (= very detailed ) There are comprehensive instructions for completing and filing the new tax form. Full instructions accompany the smoke alarm.','step-by-step instructions (= giving details of each thing you should do in order ) This book gives step-by-step instructions for making curtains.','the manufacturer’s instructions (= the instructions given by the company that made something ) Make up the mixture according to the manufacturer’s instructions.','safety instructions Written safety instructions should be supplied with all equipment.','operating instructions The operating instructions have been simplified so that they are easier to follow.','cooking instructions The cooking instructions can be found on the side of the packet.','an instruction book/manual The instruction manual for the camera is over 150 pages long.','an instruction booklet/leaflet/sheet The washing machine comes with an instruction leaflet.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He had specific instructions to check everyone’s identity cards.","translation":"او دستورات خاصی برای بررسی کارت شناسایی همه داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001798418.mp3"},{"sentence":"Mrs Edwards gave instructions that she was not to be disturbed.","translation":"خانم ادواردز دستور داد که مزاحم او نشود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001798424.mp3"},{"sentence":"On the landlord’s instructions, the barmaid refused to serve him.","translation":"به دستور صاحبخانه، خدمتکار از خدمت به او خودداری کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001798432.mp3"},{"sentence":"My instructions are (= I have been told ) to give the package to him personally.","translation":"دستورات من این است (= به من گفته شده است) بسته را شخصاً به او بدهم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001417361.mp3"},{"sentence":"Make sure you carry out the doctor’s instructions .","translation":"مطمئن شوید که دستورات پزشک را اجرا می کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001798436.mp3"},{"sentence":"The police were under instruction to fire if necessary.","translation":"پلیس تحت آموزش بود تا در صورت لزوم شلیک کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001798445.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('ecabb9d5-a016-5918-b3fd-3523437a6c81','ff5da935-c1da-520a-abcd-0071c666603d',3,null,null,'formal','teaching that you are given in a particular skill or subject','[ uncountable ]',null,'آموزش که در یک مهارت یا موضوع خاص به شما داده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['follow the instructions (= do what the instructions tell you to do ) You should follow the instructions on the packet.','read the instructions Always read the instructions before switching on the machine.','provide/supply instructions (= give someone instructions ) Detailed instructions are supplied with the software.','come with instructions The tent comes with instructions on how to put it up.','the instructions say/tell you to do something The instructions say that you should take the tablets after meals.','clear The instructions that I got with the phone weren’t very clear.','detailed There are detailed instructions on the back of the box.','written instructions Each member of the team was issued with written instructions.','full/comprehensive instructions (= very detailed ) There are comprehensive instructions for completing and filing the new tax form. Full instructions accompany the smoke alarm.','step-by-step instructions (= giving details of each thing you should do in order ) This book gives step-by-step instructions for making curtains.','the manufacturer’s instructions (= the instructions given by the company that made something ) Make up the mixture according to the manufacturer’s instructions.','safety instructions Written safety instructions should be supplied with all equipment.','operating instructions The operating instructions have been simplified so that they are easier to follow.','cooking instructions The cooking instructions can be found on the side of the packet.','an instruction book/manual The instruction manual for the camera is over 150 pages long.','an instruction booklet/leaflet/sheet The washing machine comes with an instruction leaflet.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"religious instruction","translation":"آموزش دینی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001417367.mp3"},{"sentence":"driving instruction","translation":"آموزش رانندگی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001417368.mp3"},{"sentence":"The school gives instruction in first aid.","translation":"آموزشگاه در مورد کمک های اولیه آموزش می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001417371.mp3"},{"sentence":"This group of trainees is still under instruction.","translation":"این گروه از کارآموزان همچنان تحت آموزش هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001798452.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('24a38d76-8819-56d9-84e7-2810ae27aabc','cb916377-f93d-5bd1-bf74-a8132deeb349',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an intelligent person has a high level of mental ability and is good at understanding ideas and thinking clearly',null,null,'باهوش، زیرک','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a group of highly intelligent (= very intelligent ) students","translation":"گروهی از دانش آموزان بسیار باهوش (= بسیار باهوش).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001798524.mp3"},{"sentence":"Sontag was once famously described as the most intelligent woman in America.","translation":"سونتاگ زمانی به عنوان باهوش ترین زن آمریکا توصیف می شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001980952.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('79690b50-2539-5f51-a0d9-72a05cee893f','cb916377-f93d-5bd1-bf74-a8132deeb349',2,null,null,'spoken & written','an intelligent comment , question , conversation etc shows that you have thought about something carefully and understand it well',null,null,'یک نظر هوشمندانه، سوال، گفتگو و غیره نشان می دهد که شما در مورد چیزی با دقت فکر کرده اید و آن را به خوبی درک کرده اید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"an intelligent question","translation":"یک سوال هوشمندانه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001798530.mp3"},{"sentence":"You can’t have an intelligent conversation with him.","translation":"شما نمی توانید یک مکالمه هوشمندانه با او داشته باشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001798531.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('f06b6dd4-df10-536b-bf96-255fd7971e30','cb916377-f93d-5bd1-bf74-a8132deeb349',3,null,null,'spoken & written','an intelligent creature is able to think and understand',null,null,'یک موجود باهوش قادر به تفکر و درک است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Are there intelligent beings on other planets?","translation":"آیا موجودات باهوشی در سیارات دیگر وجود دارند؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001418462.mp3"},{"sentence":"forms of intelligent life","translation":"اشکال زندگی هوشمند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001798535.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('72a86ad6-097f-5917-87e7-c349cfff501e','cb916377-f93d-5bd1-bf74-a8132deeb349',4,null,null,'spoken & written','an intelligent machine , system etc is able to learn and use information',null,null,'یک ماشین هوشمند، سیستم و غیره قادر به یادگیری و استفاده از اطلاعات است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('d959891b-18a5-5ac4-8696-b65a4bee8f57','4c4446fd-c380-5207-9886-dee1bed5eb69',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a process by which two or more things affect each other',null,null,'تعامل، برهم‌کنش؛ هم‌پژواک','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Price is determined through the interaction of demand and supply.","translation":"قیمت از طریق تعامل تقاضا و عرضه تعیین می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001419456.mp3"},{"sentence":"the complex interaction between mind and body","translation":"تعامل پیچیده بین ذهن و بدن","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001419459.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('5832c837-14be-58a2-bcf3-5f7ec92cd61c','4c4446fd-c380-5207-9886-dee1bed5eb69',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the activity of talking to other people, working together with them etc',null,null,'فعالیت صحبت کردن با افراد دیگر، همکاری با آنها و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the degree of interaction between teacher and student","translation":"میزان تعامل معلم و دانش آموز","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001419465.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('cbfcdd3c-385b-5c03-87e1-5719d6c9a003','6dd374dd-222e-577a-bf79-c330a7d1f0bd',1,null,null,'spoken & written','if something is interesting, you give it your attention because it seems unusual or exciting or provides information that you did not know about',null,null,'جالب، خواندنی، دل‌کش','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"That’s an interesting question.","translation":"این یک سوال جالب است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001721570.mp3"},{"sentence":"a really interesting TV programme","translation":"یک برنامه تلویزیونی واقعا جالب","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001721571.mp3"},{"sentence":"I found his talk very interesting.","translation":"سخنرانی او برای من بسیار جالب بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001420084.mp3"},{"sentence":"Did you meet any interesting people?","translation":"آیا با افراد جالبی آشنا شدید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001721572.mp3"},{"sentence":"It will be interesting to see what happens when he gets a bit older.","translation":"جالب است که ببینیم وقتی او کمی بزرگتر شود چه اتفاقی می افتد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001420087.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s interesting that no one remembers seeing the car.","translation":"جالب است که هیچکس ماشین را به یاد نمی آورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001721577.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('70e31209-6027-5575-8714-fe048964477d','4e5eef17-16b3-540c-833b-0c29cb8aa7d1',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to try to find out the truth about something such as a crime , accident , or scientific problem','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'تحقیق کردن، بررسی کردن (جرم، تصادف)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The state police are investigating the incident.","translation":"پلیس ایالتی در حال بررسی این حادثه است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001724293.mp3"},{"sentence":"The study investigates the impact of violent TV programming on children.","translation":"این مطالعه به بررسی تأثیر برنامه‌های تلویزیونی خشونت‌آمیز بر کودکان می‌پردازد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001724294.mp3"},{"sentence":"I heard a noise and went downstairs to investigate.","translation":"صدایی شنیدم و برای تحقیق به طبقه پایین رفتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001426094.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ll ask my colleague to look into it.","translation":"من از همکارم می خواهم که آن را بررسی کند.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,4),
('24573bbd-79e8-551f-bb90-e505b919e611','4e5eef17-16b3-540c-833b-0c29cb8aa7d1',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to try to find out more about someone’s character , actions etc, because you think they may have been involved in a crime','[ transitive ]',null,'سعی کنید بیشتر در مورد شخصیت، اعمال و غیره کسی بدانید، زیرا فکر می کنید ممکن است در یک جنایت دست داشته باشد.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Penney was already being investigated by the police on suspicion of murder.","translation":"پنی قبلاً توسط پلیس به ظن قتل تحت تحقیق بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001426100.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('35b48847-f2f6-5c42-9269-2eaca524120a','7c57ccde-63ea-57ca-b425-c55e20cd7c7c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the act of taking part in an activity or event, or the way in which you take part in it','[ uncountable ]',null,'مشارکت، درگیر بودن؛ پیوند عاطفی',array['participation']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"School officials say they welcome parental involvement.","translation":"مسئولان مدرسه می گویند از مشارکت والدین استقبال می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001724523.mp3"},{"sentence":"His new book examines the United States’ involvement in World War II.","translation":"کتاب جدید او به بررسی دخالت ایالات متحده در جنگ جهانی دوم می پردازد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001724524.mp3"},{"sentence":"Carey’s possible involvement with a series of robberies","translation":"درگیری احتمالی کری با مجموعه‌ای از سرقت‌ها","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020117.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('261288d9-f65e-5617-9549-b57b72a26768','7c57ccde-63ea-57ca-b425-c55e20cd7c7c',2,null,null,'spoken & written','something that you take part in or spend time doing','[ countable ]',null,'کاری که در آن شرکت می کنید یا زمانی را صرف آن می کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"sporting involvements","translation":"مشارکت های ورزشی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001724531.mp3"},{"sentence":"her political involvements","translation":"دخالت های سیاسی او","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001724532.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('bc78c31c-257b-5f67-8eca-88f5e0100bee','7c57ccde-63ea-57ca-b425-c55e20cd7c7c',3,null,null,'spoken & written','the feeling of excitement and satisfaction that you get from an activity','[ uncountable ]',null,'احساس هیجان و رضایتی که از یک فعالیت دریافت می کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Weaver admitted a strong emotional involvement in her client’s case.","translation":"ویور به دخالت عاطفی قوی در پرونده مشتری خود اعتراف کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001724536.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('2e2bac8a-1e2c-558d-92fd-1316488d3570','7c57ccde-63ea-57ca-b425-c55e20cd7c7c',4,null,null,'spoken & written','a romantic relationship between two people, especially when they are not married to each other','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'رابطه عاشقانه بین دو نفر، به خصوص زمانی که با یکدیگر ازدواج نکرده باشند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Donna knew nothing of her husband’s involvement with another woman.","translation":"دونا از درگیری شوهرش با زن دیگری چیزی نمی دانست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001724546.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ffc6dacc-0d2f-53ca-a3e4-bfd3a9f90985','959b458b-d390-5100-adf8-4551634244e8',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a law or set of laws',null,null,'قانون‌گذاری، قانون‌ها؛ وضع قانون','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['introduce/bring in legislation The government will introduce legislation to force brewers to list the ingredients in their beers.','pass legislation (= officially approve it so that it becomes law ) Legislation was passed banning the use of child labour.','legislation allows something It was a huge change when Russia passed legislation to allow the sale of private property.','legislation prevents something Legislation prevents the import and export of certain types of drug.','legislation requires something Legislation requires newspapers to be printed on recycled paper.','draft legislation (= write it before it is finally approved ) She is a member of the committee that is drafting the legislation.','enact legislation formal (= make it into a law ) Much legislation has been enacted to control pollution.','propose legislation (= suggest a new law ) The government proposed legislation on data protection.','a piece of legislation The most important piece of legislation was the Prevention of Fraud Act.','existing/current etc legislation The existing legislation may need to be amended.','new legislation The Government has promised new legislation to deal with the problem.','safety legislation Safety legislation requires all construction workers to wear protective headgear .','national legislation National legislation defines the powers of local authorities.','government legislation New government legislation will force manufacturers to label their products more accurately.','federal legislation American English Federal legislation is drafted primarily by the staffs of the congressional committees.','anti-terrorism legislation The House Of Representatives is expected to pass new anti-terrorism legislation today.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"It is a very important piece of legislation .","translation":"این یک قانون بسیار مهم است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00537.mp3"},{"sentence":"the legislation on abortion","translation":"قانون سقط جنین","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001749258.mp3"},{"sentence":"new legislation to protect children","translation":"قانون جدید برای حمایت از کودکان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001749261.mp3"},{"sentence":"The government is bringing in legislation to combat this problem.","translation":"دولت برای مقابله با این مشکل قوانینی را وضع می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00538.mp3"},{"sentence":"The company can be prosecuted under the new legislation.","translation":"این شرکت طبق قانون جدید قابل پیگرد قانونی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00539.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('8be26206-d8fd-5835-b415-5f423bbc87a2','6b6cd603-b4de-5608-8a31-f9712d26689f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the repairs , painting etc that are necessary to keep something in good condition',null,null,'تعمیر و نگهداری؛ مخارج نگهداری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the cost of repairs and maintenance","translation":"هزینه تعمیرات و نگهداری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001752776.mp3"},{"sentence":"The caretaker is responsible for the maintenance of the school buildings.","translation":"سرایدار مسئولیت نگهداری از ساختمان های مدرسه را بر عهده دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000174754.mp3"},{"sentence":"The theatres were closed on Saturday and Sunday for routine maintenance .","translation":"تئاترها در روزهای شنبه و یکشنبه برای تعمیر و نگهداری معمول تعطیل بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001974721.mp3"},{"sentence":"Engineers are carrying out essential maintenance work on the main line to Cambridge.","translation":"مهندسان در حال انجام کارهای تعمیر و نگهداری ضروری در خط اصلی به کمبریج هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001974725.mp3"},{"sentence":"an evening class in car maintenance","translation":"کلاس عصرانه تعمیر و نگهداری خودرو","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000174757.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('957c8d5f-3300-500f-a7ad-3787ff9c1ca7','6b6cd603-b4de-5608-8a31-f9712d26689f',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the act of making a state or situation continue',null,null,'عمل ایجاد یک وضعیت یا وضعیت ادامه یابد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The purpose of the UN is the maintenance of international peace and security.","translation":"هدف سازمان ملل متحد حفظ صلح و امنیت بین المللی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001534133.mp3"},{"sentence":"The maintenance of a firm currency plays an important part in the battle against inflation.","translation":"حفظ یک ارز ثابت نقش مهمی در مبارزه با تورم دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001534134.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('971c08d9-7978-5e74-b88e-10e5d58db529','6b6cd603-b4de-5608-8a31-f9712d26689f',3,null,null,'spoken & written','money paid by someone who is divorced to their former wife or husband',null,null,'پولی که کسی که طلاق گرفته است به همسر یا شوهر سابق خود پرداخت می کند',array['alimony']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"They have to find the fathers who abandon their children and make them pay maintenance.","translation":"آنها باید پدرانی را پیدا کنند که فرزندان خود را رها کرده و آنها را مجبور به پرداخت نفقه کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001534136.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('692640a9-fce5-572d-8587-0636b237937b','741d862d-11e7-5b7d-885e-ba7f8177f04a',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the length , height etc of something','[ countable ]',null,'اندازه‌گیری، سنجش؛ اندازه (پهنا)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['take/make a measurement (= measure something ) Scientists take daily measurements to find out if the ocean temperature is increasing.','get a measurement You get a more accurate measurement holding the tape this way.','take somebody’s measurements (= measure someone for a piece of clothing ) She was having her measurements taken for her wedding dress.','accurate When making curtains, you need accurate measurements of the window.','exact/precise It''s about 10 metres by 8 metres - I don''t know the exact measurements. This special equipment allows us to make very precise measurements.','a careful measurement (= an accurate measurement – used when you are emphasizing the process of measuring ) Careful measurements of the human skull were taken and recorded.','a direct measurement (= one made by measuring the thing itself, not a photograph of it ) Instruments in space allowed a direct measurement of Jupiter’s temperature.','an objective measurement (= one that is not influenced by your opinions or feelings ) The test provides an objective measurement of the student’s listening skills.','somebody''s waist/chest/leg etc measurement What is his waist measurement?']::text[],'[{"sentence":"What’s your waist measurement?","translation":"اندازه دور کمر شما چقدر است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000217454.mp3"},{"sentence":"Take measurements of the room before you buy any new furniture.","translation":"قبل از خرید مبلمان جدید، اتاق را اندازه گیری کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000217458.mp3"},{"sentence":"The assistant took my measurements and showed me what was available in my size.","translation":"دستیار اندازه های من را گرفت و به من نشان داد که چه چیزی در اندازه من موجود است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001714687.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('8a372fe8-8bb9-5303-a16b-1cc91b1fdd25','741d862d-11e7-5b7d-885e-ba7f8177f04a',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the act of measuring something','[ uncountable ]',null,'عمل اندازه گیری چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['take/make a measurement (= measure something ) Scientists take daily measurements to find out if the ocean temperature is increasing.','get a measurement You get a more accurate measurement holding the tape this way.','take somebody’s measurements (= measure someone for a piece of clothing ) She was having her measurements taken for her wedding dress.','accurate When making curtains, you need accurate measurements of the window.','exact/precise It''s about 10 metres by 8 metres - I don''t know the exact measurements. This special equipment allows us to make very precise measurements.','a careful measurement (= an accurate measurement – used when you are emphasizing the process of measuring ) Careful measurements of the human skull were taken and recorded.','a direct measurement (= one made by measuring the thing itself, not a photograph of it ) Instruments in space allowed a direct measurement of Jupiter’s temperature.','an objective measurement (= one that is not influenced by your opinions or feelings ) The test provides an objective measurement of the student’s listening skills.','somebody''s waist/chest/leg etc measurement What is his waist measurement?']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the measurement of performance","translation":"اندازه گیری عملکرد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001714690.mp3"},{"sentence":"accurate measurement of body temperature","translation":"اندازه گیری دقیق دمای بدن","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001714691.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('29594ffe-1699-55f4-942f-42816b0b8fc7','dcdc3e9e-f879-595b-a3ae-f5eeea4f7c4c',1,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'not necessarily','ضرورتاً، ناگزیر؛ لزوماً','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('3261097a-b6ee-50b0-97f8-b06613db4d14','dcdc3e9e-f879-595b-a3ae-f5eeea4f7c4c',2,null,null,'formal','in a way that cannot be different or be avoided',null,null,'به گونه ای که نمی توان متفاوت باشد یا از آن اجتناب کرد',array['inevitably']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The care of old people necessarily involves quite a lot of heavy lifting.","translation":"مراقبت از افراد مسن لزوماً شامل انجام کارهای سنگین است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000235753.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('657a45a7-394e-5587-b05b-6213c86ad45e','e49fef11-d04b-5582-a2ac-877eabcf9279',1,null,null,'spoken & written','official discussions between the representatives of opposing groups who are trying to reach an agreement , especially in business or politics',null,null,'مذاکره، چانه‌زنی؛ مذاکرات (رسمی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['long/lengthy After lengthy negotiations, a compromise was finally reached.','prolonged/protracted (= very long ) Despite protracted negotiations, the two sides have failed to reach agreement.','difficult The agreement is the result of two years of long and difficult negotiations.','delicate (= in which it would be very easy to upset people and cause the negotiations to fail ) The company is about to start delicate negotiations with the union about next year''s pay agreement.','intense (= done with a lot of effort ) The agreement came after months of intense negotiations.','peace/trade etc negotiations A new round of global trade negotiations is due to start next week.','enter into/open negotiations (= start negotiations ) They have entered into negotiations to acquire another company.','conduct negotiations The country should conduct direct negotiations with its neighbours.','break off negotiations (= stop them ) The two companies have broken off negotiations on the deal.','resume negotiations (= start them again ) The pressure is on Israel and the Palestinians to resume peace negotiations.','negotiations start Peace negotiations started last week.','negotiations stall (= stop making progress ) The negotiations stalled over the question of arms reductions.','negotiations break down (= stop because of disagreement ) The negotiations broke down over a dispute about working conditions.','be under negotiation (= be being discussed ) The contract is currently under negotiation.','be open to negotiation (= be able to be discussed ) The price is usually open to negotiation.','be open to negotiation (= be willing to discuss something ) The president signalled that he is open to negotiation on the budget.','be subject to negotiation (= be something that must be discussed ) The pay is subject to negotiation.','a round of negotiations (= one part of a series of negotiations ) the next round of negotiations on trade barriers','the initial/early/final stages of negotiation The offer was in the final stages of negotiation.','a breakdown in negotiations (= an occasion when negotiations cannot continue because of a disagreement ) There has been a breakdown in negotiations with the union.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The negotiations with the company had reached a crucial stage.","translation":"مذاکرات با این شرکت به مرحله حساسی رسیده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001567516.mp3"},{"sentence":"This follows private negotiations between the landowner and the leisure centre.","translation":"این به دنبال مذاکرات خصوصی بین مالک زمین و مرکز تفریحی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001567519.mp3"},{"sentence":"He is trying to involve community leaders in negotiations on reform.","translation":"او در تلاش است تا رهبران جامعه را در مذاکرات اصلاحات مشارکت دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001762605.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('72a09909-e143-5b02-8663-9ccd703ee8c1','b414c171-6b3f-54c2-b7b5-a6c9e88ae0b5',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the process of watching something or someone carefully for a period of time','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'مشاهده، رصد؛ نظر (خود)؛ رعایت (قوانین)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['be under observation (= be in the process of being watched ) The police said that the house had been under observation.','keep somebody under observation (= closely watch someone or something over a period of time ) The doctor ordered that the patient be kept under observation.','somebody’s powers of observation (= someone’s abilty to watch things in a way that helps them learn and understand more ) In the past, people used their own powers of observation to forecast the weather.','close/careful/detailed observation A lot of useful knowledge is gained by careful observation of the world around you.','casual observation (= observation that is not done in a very careful or organized way ) Even casual observation makes this theory improbable.','direct observation Piaget developed his theories based on direct observation of children.','personal observation (= watching and understanding something yourself, rather than hearing or reading about it ) I knew cigarettes were addictive from personal observation.','scientific observation (= observation done for scientific purposes ) Scientific observation led to the discovery of vaccines.','classroom observation (= observation of a teacher and children in a classroom ) Classroom observation is only part of what school inspectors do.','an observation post/point (= a place from where you can observe something ) The peak of the mountain was a natural location for an observation post.','an observation deck/platform/tower (= a structure that is built in order to observe something ) The army built an observation tower on the top of the building.','a period of observation The hospital released him after a period of observation.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Bloomfield’s approach to linguistics was based on observation of the language.","translation":"رویکرد بلومفیلد به زبان شناسی مبتنی بر مشاهده زبان بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000257308.mp3"},{"sentence":"He spent two nights under close observation in hospital.","translation":"او دو شب را در بیمارستان تحت نظارت دقیق گذراند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001557517.mp3"},{"sentence":"His orders were to keep the men under observation .","translation":"دستور او این بود که مردان را تحت نظر نگه دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001557518.mp3"},{"sentence":"Art classes help develop children’s powers of observation .","translation":"کلاس های هنری به تقویت قدرت مشاهده کودکان کمک می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001557524.mp3"},{"sentence":"Careful observation suggests that this is not the case.","translation":"مشاهدات دقیق نشان می دهد که اینطور نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001969451.mp3"},{"sentence":"Detailed observations were carried out on the behaviour of the students.","translation":"مشاهدات دقیقی بر روی رفتار دانش آموزان انجام شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001969454.mp3"},{"sentence":"From their direct observations , children absorb a model of marriage.","translation":"از مشاهدات مستقیم آنها، کودکان مدلی از ازدواج را جذب می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001969457.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('0f7aa303-6430-5bd7-a317-34f613cae464','b414c171-6b3f-54c2-b7b5-a6c9e88ae0b5',2,null,null,'spoken & written','something that you notice when watching something or someone','[ countable ]',null,'چیزی که هنگام تماشای چیزی یا کسی متوجه آن می شوید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['be under observation (= be in the process of being watched ) The police said that the house had been under observation.','keep somebody under observation (= closely watch someone or something over a period of time ) The doctor ordered that the patient be kept under observation.','somebody’s powers of observation (= someone’s abilty to watch things in a way that helps them learn and understand more ) In the past, people used their own powers of observation to forecast the weather.','close/careful/detailed observation A lot of useful knowledge is gained by careful observation of the world around you.','casual observation (= observation that is not done in a very careful or organized way ) Even casual observation makes this theory improbable.','direct observation Piaget developed his theories based on direct observation of children.','personal observation (= watching and understanding something yourself, rather than hearing or reading about it ) I knew cigarettes were addictive from personal observation.','scientific observation (= observation done for scientific purposes ) Scientific observation led to the discovery of vaccines.','classroom observation (= observation of a teacher and children in a classroom ) Classroom observation is only part of what school inspectors do.','an observation post/point (= a place from where you can observe something ) The peak of the mountain was a natural location for an observation post.','an observation deck/platform/tower (= a structure that is built in order to observe something ) The army built an observation tower on the top of the building.','a period of observation The hospital released him after a period of observation.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Some interesting observations emerged from this research.","translation":"مشاهدات جالبی از این تحقیق به دست آمد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001557532.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('355f375d-e70d-58da-bd13-6e7b13f0e185','b414c171-6b3f-54c2-b7b5-a6c9e88ae0b5',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a spoken or written remark about something you have noticed','[ countable ]',null,'اظهار نظر گفتاری یا نوشتاری در مورد چیزی که متوجه شده اید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['be under observation (= be in the process of being watched ) The police said that the house had been under observation.','keep somebody under observation (= closely watch someone or something over a period of time ) The doctor ordered that the patient be kept under observation.','somebody’s powers of observation (= someone’s abilty to watch things in a way that helps them learn and understand more ) In the past, people used their own powers of observation to forecast the weather.','close/careful/detailed observation A lot of useful knowledge is gained by careful observation of the world around you.','casual observation (= observation that is not done in a very careful or organized way ) Even casual observation makes this theory improbable.','direct observation Piaget developed his theories based on direct observation of children.','personal observation (= watching and understanding something yourself, rather than hearing or reading about it ) I knew cigarettes were addictive from personal observation.','scientific observation (= observation done for scientific purposes ) Scientific observation led to the discovery of vaccines.','classroom observation (= observation of a teacher and children in a classroom ) Classroom observation is only part of what school inspectors do.','an observation post/point (= a place from where you can observe something ) The peak of the mountain was a natural location for an observation post.','an observation deck/platform/tower (= a structure that is built in order to observe something ) The army built an observation tower on the top of the building.','a period of observation The hospital released him after a period of observation.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Darwin’s observations on the habits of certain birds","translation":"مشاهدات داروین در مورد عادات پرندگان خاص","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000257320.mp3"},{"sentence":"Paz makes some observations about the role of the critic.","translation":"پاز در مورد نقش منتقد ملاحظاتی دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001557533.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('ee808be0-0b59-5454-83e3-368a53d0a087','b414c171-6b3f-54c2-b7b5-a6c9e88ae0b5',4,null,null,'spoken & written','the act of obeying a law etc','[ uncountable ]',null,'عمل اطاعت از قانون و غیره',array['observance']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['be under observation (= be in the process of being watched ) The police said that the house had been under observation.','keep somebody under observation (= closely watch someone or something over a period of time ) The doctor ordered that the patient be kept under observation.','somebody’s powers of observation (= someone’s abilty to watch things in a way that helps them learn and understand more ) In the past, people used their own powers of observation to forecast the weather.','close/careful/detailed observation A lot of useful knowledge is gained by careful observation of the world around you.','casual observation (= observation that is not done in a very careful or organized way ) Even casual observation makes this theory improbable.','direct observation Piaget developed his theories based on direct observation of children.','personal observation (= watching and understanding something yourself, rather than hearing or reading about it ) I knew cigarettes were addictive from personal observation.','scientific observation (= observation done for scientific purposes ) Scientific observation led to the discovery of vaccines.','classroom observation (= observation of a teacher and children in a classroom ) Classroom observation is only part of what school inspectors do.','an observation post/point (= a place from where you can observe something ) The peak of the mountain was a natural location for an observation post.','an observation deck/platform/tower (= a structure that is built in order to observe something ) The army built an observation tower on the top of the building.','a period of observation The hospital released him after a period of observation.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('46ec4c65-6e26-5365-9f10-f46aa036b39e','08ed5ce0-be5b-5b61-bcab-87b27ee12214',1,null,null,'spoken & written','each other',null,null,'یکدیگر، هم‌دیگر (متقابل)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Liz and I have known one another for years.","translation":"من و لیز سالهاست که یکدیگر را می شناسیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000264084.mp3"},{"sentence":"They often stay at one another’s houses.","translation":"آنها اغلب در خانه های یکدیگر می مانند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000264085.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('21a38863-1a7f-5f21-bc5e-036e23090d1d','9ff8127a-041c-580c-88ce-7bd419a1bab6',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to say that two or more people or things do the same thing to each other or share a relationship',null,null,'معمولاً می گفت که دو یا چند نفر یا چیزهای مشابهی با یکدیگر انجام می دهند یا یک رابطه مشترک دارند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"They seem to love one another very much.","translation":"به نظر می رسد که آنها یکدیگر را بسیار دوست دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000941557.mp3"},{"sentence":"The streets are all at right angles to one another.","translation":"خیابان ها همه در زوایای قائم با یکدیگر قرار دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821716.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('b6c32d96-8426-5378-b66d-1977c17e6bd3','5de62853-1d2c-52dd-bb69-72acbbfc0f50',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a chance to do something or an occasion when it is easy for you to do something','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'فرصت، امکان؛ موقعیت (تلاش)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have opportunity I was lucky enough to have the opportunity to travel.','take/use opportunity (= do something you have a chance to do ) Several employees took the opportunity to retire early.','seize/grasp an opportunity (= do something very eagerly when you have the chance ) She saw an opportunity to speak to him, and seized it.','miss/lose an opportunity (= not do something you have a chance to do ) Dwyer never missed an opportunity to criticize her.','give somebody opportunity The children should be given the opportunity to make their own choices.','get an opportunity I decided to go, as I might never get this opportunity again.','provide/present/open up an opportunity The course also provides an opportunity to study Japanese.','an opportunity comes (along/up) We had outgrown our house when the opportunity came up to buy one with more land.','an opportunity arises Perhaps she would explain later, if the opportunity arose.','a good/great/wonderful etc opportunity It''s a great opportunity to try new things.','the ideal/perfect opportunity I''d been wanting to try sailing, and this seemed like the ideal opportunity.','a golden opportunity (= a very good opportunity ) The council has missed a golden opportunity to improve the town centre.','a rare/unique opportunity a unique opportunity to stay in a real castle','a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity (= a very good opportunity that you will only get once ) For many athletes, the Olympics are a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.','a wasted/lost/missed opportunity (= one you do not use ) Many people see the failed talks as a missed opportunity for peace.','ample opportunity/plenty of opportunity (= a number of chances to do something ) There will be ample opportunity for shopping.','limited/little opportunity (= not many chances ) They had little opportunity to discuss the issue beforehand.','a photo opportunity (= a chance to take a good photograph, especially of a particular person ) Parents will always look for good photo opportunities at their kid''s graduation ceremony.','at the first/earliest opportunity (= as soon as possible ) He decided to leave school at the earliest opportunity.','at every (possible) opportunity (= whenever possible ) She went to the museum at every opportunity.','a window of opportunity (= a time when you can do something ) The other team started making mistakes, but we didn''t take advantage of this window of opportunity.','a land of opportunity (= a country where people have a lot of good opportunities ) America was then seen as a land of opportunity.','the opportunity of a lifetime (= a very good opportunity that you will only get once ) The winner of the contest got the opportunity of a lifetime – the chance to work with a top fashion designer.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a rare opportunity to see inside this historic building","translation":"فرصتی نادر برای دیدن داخل این بنای تاریخی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001136.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’d like to take this opportunity to thank you all.","translation":"مایلم از این فرصت استفاده کنم و از همه شما تشکر کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001137.mp3"},{"sentence":"Games and songs provide an opportunity for classroom interaction.","translation":"بازی ها و آهنگ ها فرصتی برای تعامل کلاس درس فراهم می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001138.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('0f204403-2388-5bd9-91be-9a3f5dad7a9e','5de62853-1d2c-52dd-bb69-72acbbfc0f50',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a chance to get a job or improve your situation at work','[ countable ]','equal opportunities 1 ( 2 )','فرصتی برای یافتن شغل یا بهبود وضعیت خود در محل کار','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have opportunity I was lucky enough to have the opportunity to travel.','take/use opportunity (= do something you have a chance to do ) Several employees took the opportunity to retire early.','seize/grasp an opportunity (= do something very eagerly when you have the chance ) She saw an opportunity to speak to him, and seized it.','miss/lose an opportunity (= not do something you have a chance to do ) Dwyer never missed an opportunity to criticize her.','give somebody opportunity The children should be given the opportunity to make their own choices.','get an opportunity I decided to go, as I might never get this opportunity again.','provide/present/open up an opportunity The course also provides an opportunity to study Japanese.','an opportunity comes (along/up) We had outgrown our house when the opportunity came up to buy one with more land.','an opportunity arises Perhaps she would explain later, if the opportunity arose.','a good/great/wonderful etc opportunity It''s a great opportunity to try new things.','the ideal/perfect opportunity I''d been wanting to try sailing, and this seemed like the ideal opportunity.','a golden opportunity (= a very good opportunity ) The council has missed a golden opportunity to improve the town centre.','a rare/unique opportunity a unique opportunity to stay in a real castle','a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity (= a very good opportunity that you will only get once ) For many athletes, the Olympics are a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.','a wasted/lost/missed opportunity (= one you do not use ) Many people see the failed talks as a missed opportunity for peace.','ample opportunity/plenty of opportunity (= a number of chances to do something ) There will be ample opportunity for shopping.','limited/little opportunity (= not many chances ) They had little opportunity to discuss the issue beforehand.','a photo opportunity (= a chance to take a good photograph, especially of a particular person ) Parents will always look for good photo opportunities at their kid''s graduation ceremony.','at the first/earliest opportunity (= as soon as possible ) He decided to leave school at the earliest opportunity.','at every (possible) opportunity (= whenever possible ) She went to the museum at every opportunity.','a window of opportunity (= a time when you can do something ) The other team started making mistakes, but we didn''t take advantage of this window of opportunity.','a land of opportunity (= a country where people have a lot of good opportunities ) America was then seen as a land of opportunity.','the opportunity of a lifetime (= a very good opportunity that you will only get once ) The winner of the contest got the opportunity of a lifetime – the chance to work with a top fashion designer.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There are fewer opportunities for new graduates this year.","translation":"امسال فرصت های کمتری برای فارغ التحصیلان جدید وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000267231.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ebf510be-0c0e-5bf7-a13b-4f328f12d348','d1b919eb-1888-5d95-a121-8e2d1b32b100',1,null,null,'spoken & written','extremely good',null,null,'درخشان، برجسته؛ بدهی معوق (مبلغ)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"an outstanding example of a 13th-century castle","translation":"یک نمونه برجسته از یک قلعه قرن سیزدهم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001571081.mp3"},{"sentence":"an outstanding success","translation":"یک موفقیت برجسته","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001571085.mp3"},{"sentence":"His performance was outstanding.","translation":"عملکرد او فوق العاده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001571089.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('2022acce-87d1-5f09-8d2f-18853554b4cf','d1b919eb-1888-5d95-a121-8e2d1b32b100',2,null,null,'spoken & written','not yet done, solved , or paid',null,null,'هنوز انجام نشده، حل نشده یا پرداخت نشده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We’ve got quite a few debts still outstanding.","translation":"ما هنوز بدهی های زیادی داریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000383840.mp3"},{"sentence":"an outstanding issue","translation":"یک موضوع برجسته","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000383841.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('ebee5e31-eeea-5412-af2c-069e92f416e2','d1b919eb-1888-5d95-a121-8e2d1b32b100',3,null,null,'spoken & written','very great or clear',null,null,'خیلی عالی یا واضح','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The question of who is in charge is of outstanding importance.","translation":"این سوال که چه کسی مسئول است از اهمیت فوق العاده ای برخوردار است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001571092.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('b5b05f2a-7982-536c-bfe3-c7b3b64a825b','c9a9929d-1ea4-58a6-9cdc-cef9ecc8e463',1,null,null,'formal','to take part in an activity or event',null,null,'مشارکت کردن، شرکت کردن (در)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Some members refused to participate.","translation":"برخی از اعضا حاضر به شرکت نشدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001558991.mp3"},{"sentence":"Everyone in the class is expected to participate actively in these discussions.","translation":"از همه افراد کلاس انتظار می رود که فعالانه در این بحث ها شرکت کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000367309.mp3"},{"sentence":"They welcomed the opportunity to participate fully in the life of the village.","translation":"آنها از این فرصت برای مشارکت کامل در زندگی روستا استقبال کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001558987.mp3"},{"sentence":"She refused to take part in any of the activities.","translation":"او از شرکت در هر یک از فعالیت ها خودداری کرد.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,4),
('650a1013-53df-503b-9954-1dc108be2f5c','a1010d15-8289-5891-b831-7e71754ab2fe',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the state of being a partner in business','[ uncountable ]',null,'شراکت، همکاری (تجاری)؛ شراکت (مادی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’ve been in partnership with her for five years.","translation":"من پنج سال است که با او شراکت دارم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000368463.mp3"},{"sentence":"She’s gone into partnership with two local doctors.","translation":"او با دو پزشک محلی همکاری کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559102.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('6616a6b6-9035-56d4-acf1-4ad79910072c','a1010d15-8289-5891-b831-7e71754ab2fe',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a business owned by two or more people','[ countable ]',null,'یک کسب و کار متعلق به دو یا چند نفر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s one of the most successful partnerships in the country.","translation":"این یکی از موفق ترین مشارکت ها در کشور است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000368471.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('6dea73d1-bac1-5550-9aae-091b32acfb37','a1010d15-8289-5891-b831-7e71754ab2fe',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a relationship between two people, organizations , or countries','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'رابطه بین دو فرد، سازمان یا کشور','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['form a partnership They formed a partnership solely to enter the competition.','forge a partnership (= form one ) He has forged a highly successful partnership with the Dublin singer Frances Black.','develop a partnership Developing international partnerships is vital to our continued success.','a working partnership Theirs is one of the most fruitful working partnerships in modern science.','a close partnership The two companies have built up a close partnership over the past four years.','an effective partnership The agency tries to forge effective partnerships with communities and private businesses.','a successful partnership We are looking forward to a successful partnership.','a good partnership It’s a good partnership and we think it’s going to get better.','an equal partnership They regard marriage as an equal partnership.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Several youth charities have formed a partnership to help these homeless teenagers.","translation":"چندین موسسه خیریه جوانان برای کمک به این نوجوانان بی خانمان مشارکتی تشکیل داده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000368476.mp3"},{"sentence":"The close partnership between Britain and the US will continue.","translation":"همکاری نزدیک بریتانیا و آمریکا ادامه خواهد یافت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559114.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('ff3e45e6-60c3-59a2-964f-e7f7b2dce9b2','9889b360-46c8-5a4d-a2a0-1d98a71016b2',1,null,null,'spoken & written','when someone performs a play or a piece of music','[ countable ]',null,'اجرا، اجرای (نمایش)؛ عملکرد (فرد)؛ نمایش','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give a performance Samuel Jackson gives a terrific performance as Elijah.','turn in/deliver a performance (= give a performance ) Both actors turn in great performances. In the role of Carmen, Ms Leblanc delivered a quite exquisite performance.','go to a performance ( also attend a performance formal ) We can go to the evening performance if you prefer. The Princess attended a performance of The Magic Flute at the London Coliseum.','a fine/great performance There are fine performances by Kathy Bates and Daryl Hannah.','a memorable performance (= good and easy to remember ) There were memorable performances from Madonna and U2.','a brilliant/magnificent/superb performance Rogers gave a brilliant performance of Chopin’s Piano Concerto No. 1.','a virtuoso performance (= one showing great skill ) He delivered a virtuoso performance as The Phantom Of The Opera.','a live performance (= one performed for people who are watching ) This is the band’s first live performance since last year.','a solo performance (= one performed by a single musician, not a group ) Young’s solo performances are often his most effective.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Their performance of Mozart’s Concerto in E flat was finely controlled and dramatic.","translation":"اجرای کنسرتو موتزارت در E flat به خوبی کنترل شده و دراماتیک بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020166.mp3"},{"sentence":"This evening’s performance will begin at 8.00 pm.","translation":"اجرای این شب از ساعت 20 آغاز خواهد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000350904.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('0acd15ec-a941-5078-956b-5fcf3df4de49','9889b360-46c8-5a4d-a2a0-1d98a71016b2',2,null,null,'spoken & written','how well or badly a person, company etc does a particular job or activity','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'یک شخص، شرکت و غیره چقدر خوب یا بد یک کار یا فعالیت خاص را انجام می دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give a performance Samuel Jackson gives a terrific performance as Elijah.','turn in/deliver a performance (= give a performance ) Both actors turn in great performances. In the role of Carmen, Ms Leblanc delivered a quite exquisite performance.','go to a performance ( also attend a performance formal ) We can go to the evening performance if you prefer. The Princess attended a performance of The Magic Flute at the London Coliseum.','a fine/great performance There are fine performances by Kathy Bates and Daryl Hannah.','a memorable performance (= good and easy to remember ) There were memorable performances from Madonna and U2.','a brilliant/magnificent/superb performance Rogers gave a brilliant performance of Chopin’s Piano Concerto No. 1.','a virtuoso performance (= one showing great skill ) He delivered a virtuoso performance as The Phantom Of The Opera.','a live performance (= one performed for people who are watching ) This is the band’s first live performance since last year.','a solo performance (= one performed by a single musician, not a group ) Young’s solo performances are often his most effective.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Sean’s performance at school has greatly improved.","translation":"عملکرد شان در مدرسه بسیار بهبود یافته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000350915.mp3"},{"sentence":"I was impressed by the team’s performance.","translation":"من تحت تاثیر عملکرد تیم قرار گرفتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001186.mp3"},{"sentence":"The country’s economic performance so far this year has been good.","translation":"عملکرد اقتصادی کشور در سال جاری تاکنون خوب بوده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040167.mp3"},{"sentence":"Shareholders blamed him for the company’s poor performance .","translation":"سهامداران او را به خاطر عملکرد ضعیف شرکت سرزنش کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00645.mp3"},{"sentence":"her disappointing performance in the Olympics","translation":"عملکرد ناامید کننده او در المپیک","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040169.mp3"},{"sentence":"Exam results are used as performance indicators (= things that show how well something is done ) for schools.","translation":"نتایج امتحانات به عنوان شاخص های عملکرد (= چیزهایی که نشان می دهد چقدر خوب انجام شده است) برای مدارس استفاده می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559957.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('831b3e1c-0e9c-5398-8a35-1e69a1fe18d5','9889b360-46c8-5a4d-a2a0-1d98a71016b2',3,null,null,'spoken & written','the act of doing a piece of work, duty etc','[ uncountable ]',null,'انجام یک کار، وظیفه و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give a performance Samuel Jackson gives a terrific performance as Elijah.','turn in/deliver a performance (= give a performance ) Both actors turn in great performances. In the role of Carmen, Ms Leblanc delivered a quite exquisite performance.','go to a performance ( also attend a performance formal ) We can go to the evening performance if you prefer. The Princess attended a performance of The Magic Flute at the London Coliseum.','a fine/great performance There are fine performances by Kathy Bates and Daryl Hannah.','a memorable performance (= good and easy to remember ) There were memorable performances from Madonna and U2.','a brilliant/magnificent/superb performance Rogers gave a brilliant performance of Chopin’s Piano Concerto No. 1.','a virtuoso performance (= one showing great skill ) He delivered a virtuoso performance as The Phantom Of The Opera.','a live performance (= one performed for people who are watching ) This is the band’s first live performance since last year.','a solo performance (= one performed by a single musician, not a group ) Young’s solo performances are often his most effective.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the performance of his official duties","translation":"انجام وظایف رسمی خود","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559967.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('93550f7c-5855-5f5a-8425-030010c2c8f3','9889b360-46c8-5a4d-a2a0-1d98a71016b2',4,null,null,'spoken & written','how well a car or other machine works','[ uncountable ]',null,'یک ماشین یا ماشین دیگر چقدر خوب کار می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give a performance Samuel Jackson gives a terrific performance as Elijah.','turn in/deliver a performance (= give a performance ) Both actors turn in great performances. In the role of Carmen, Ms Leblanc delivered a quite exquisite performance.','go to a performance ( also attend a performance formal ) We can go to the evening performance if you prefer. The Princess attended a performance of The Magic Flute at the London Coliseum.','a fine/great performance There are fine performances by Kathy Bates and Daryl Hannah.','a memorable performance (= good and easy to remember ) There were memorable performances from Madonna and U2.','a brilliant/magnificent/superb performance Rogers gave a brilliant performance of Chopin’s Piano Concerto No. 1.','a virtuoso performance (= one showing great skill ) He delivered a virtuoso performance as The Phantom Of The Opera.','a live performance (= one performed for people who are watching ) This is the band’s first live performance since last year.','a solo performance (= one performed by a single musician, not a group ) Young’s solo performances are often his most effective.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The car’s performance on mountain roads was impressive.","translation":"عملکرد خودرو در جاده های کوهستانی چشمگیر بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000350921.mp3"},{"sentence":"an imaging system using high-performance (= very effective ) technology","translation":"یک سیستم تصویربرداری با استفاده از فناوری با کارایی بالا (= بسیار موثر).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559968.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('8690f920-4db1-5d04-8849-a2a5e2e57a21','9889b360-46c8-5a4d-a2a0-1d98a71016b2',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'a performance','اجرا، اجرای (نمایش)؛ عملکرد (فرد)؛ نمایش','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give a performance Samuel Jackson gives a terrific performance as Elijah.','turn in/deliver a performance (= give a performance ) Both actors turn in great performances. In the role of Carmen, Ms Leblanc delivered a quite exquisite performance.','go to a performance ( also attend a performance formal ) We can go to the evening performance if you prefer. The Princess attended a performance of The Magic Flute at the London Coliseum.','a fine/great performance There are fine performances by Kathy Bates and Daryl Hannah.','a memorable performance (= good and easy to remember ) There were memorable performances from Madonna and U2.','a brilliant/magnificent/superb performance Rogers gave a brilliant performance of Chopin’s Piano Concerto No. 1.','a virtuoso performance (= one showing great skill ) He delivered a virtuoso performance as The Phantom Of The Opera.','a live performance (= one performed for people who are watching ) This is the band’s first live performance since last year.','a solo performance (= one performed by a single musician, not a group ) Young’s solo performances are often his most effective.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('2b285b6c-cac8-55d5-97e7-3e9036c31b8c','e5db5bca-82b2-50b3-ac5d-8cb7226979ef',1,null,null,'spoken & written','someone’s character , especially the way they behave towards other people','[ countable, uncountable ]','split personality','شخصیت، کاراکتر؛ شخصیت (سرشناس)؛ حیث (حالت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a strong personality Mercer has a strong personality and always tells you his opinion.','a forceful personality The architect’s forceful personality ensured that the work progressed rapidly.','a dominant personality (= controlling other people ) He had a dominant personality and could be a bit of a bully.','a warm personality (= friendly and kind to people ) Everyone who knew Roseanne will miss her warm personality.','an outgoing/extrovert personality (= liking to talk to people ) The job requires someone with an outgoing personality.','an engaging personality (= pleasant, so that people like you ) He is strikingly handsome with a very engaging personality.','a bubbly personality (= happy and eager to do things ) Her bright and bubbly personality made her one of the most popular girls in her year.','a lively/vivacious personality (= liking to meet and talk to people ) Her lively personality won her many admirers.','a charismatic personality (= strong and attractive, so that people admire and respect you ) Like many other people, I was attracted by his charismatic personality.','a personality trait formal (= a part of your personality ) She shares many of her mother’s personality traits.','a personality disorder (= a mental illness affecting someone’s personality ) The hospital treats patients with severe personality disorders.','a personality clash (= when people cannot work together because they are so different ) The band eventually split because of personality clashes.','a personality test Employers are increasingly using personality tests to help them select staff.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Despite their different personalities, they became the best of friends.","translation":"با وجود شخصیت های متفاوت، آنها بهترین دوستان شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001584554.mp3"},{"sentence":"Unfortunately, the illness can lead to changes in personality.","translation":"متأسفانه، این بیماری می تواند منجر به تغییراتی در شخصیت شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001192.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('8fc0a579-318c-5c7c-a787-26b6b196093c','e5db5bca-82b2-50b3-ac5d-8cb7226979ef',2,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who is very famous and often appears in the newspapers , on television etc, especially an entertainer or sports person','[ countable ]',null,'کسی که بسیار مشهور است و اغلب در روزنامه ها، تلویزیون و غیره ظاهر می شود، به ویژه یک فرد سرگرم کننده یا ورزش','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a strong personality Mercer has a strong personality and always tells you his opinion.','a forceful personality The architect’s forceful personality ensured that the work progressed rapidly.','a dominant personality (= controlling other people ) He had a dominant personality and could be a bit of a bully.','a warm personality (= friendly and kind to people ) Everyone who knew Roseanne will miss her warm personality.','an outgoing/extrovert personality (= liking to talk to people ) The job requires someone with an outgoing personality.','an engaging personality (= pleasant, so that people like you ) He is strikingly handsome with a very engaging personality.','a bubbly personality (= happy and eager to do things ) Her bright and bubbly personality made her one of the most popular girls in her year.','a lively/vivacious personality (= liking to meet and talk to people ) Her lively personality won her many admirers.','a charismatic personality (= strong and attractive, so that people admire and respect you ) Like many other people, I was attracted by his charismatic personality.','a personality trait formal (= a part of your personality ) She shares many of her mother’s personality traits.','a personality disorder (= a mental illness affecting someone’s personality ) The hospital treats patients with severe personality disorders.','a personality clash (= when people cannot work together because they are so different ) The band eventually split because of personality clashes.','a personality test Employers are increasingly using personality tests to help them select staff.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"one of the most well-liked TV personalities","translation":"یکی از محبوب ترین شخصیت های تلویزیونی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001584562.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('f9e94c30-26f0-50f8-b2cd-2464cd77a798','e5db5bca-82b2-50b3-ac5d-8cb7226979ef',3,null,null,'spoken & written','the qualities of character that make someone interesting or enjoyable to be with','[ uncountable ]',null,'ویژگی‌های شخصیتی که باعث می‌شود کسی با او بودن جالب یا لذت بخش باشد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a strong personality Mercer has a strong personality and always tells you his opinion.','a forceful personality The architect’s forceful personality ensured that the work progressed rapidly.','a dominant personality (= controlling other people ) He had a dominant personality and could be a bit of a bully.','a warm personality (= friendly and kind to people ) Everyone who knew Roseanne will miss her warm personality.','an outgoing/extrovert personality (= liking to talk to people ) The job requires someone with an outgoing personality.','an engaging personality (= pleasant, so that people like you ) He is strikingly handsome with a very engaging personality.','a bubbly personality (= happy and eager to do things ) Her bright and bubbly personality made her one of the most popular girls in her year.','a lively/vivacious personality (= liking to meet and talk to people ) Her lively personality won her many admirers.','a charismatic personality (= strong and attractive, so that people admire and respect you ) Like many other people, I was attracted by his charismatic personality.','a personality trait formal (= a part of your personality ) She shares many of her mother’s personality traits.','a personality disorder (= a mental illness affecting someone’s personality ) The hospital treats patients with severe personality disorders.','a personality clash (= when people cannot work together because they are so different ) The band eventually split because of personality clashes.','a personality test Employers are increasingly using personality tests to help them select staff.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He’s honest but he lacks personality.","translation":"او صادق است اما فاقد شخصیت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000353326.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c7cc283f-2b38-5109-95db-c6d1456c4f9a','e5db5bca-82b2-50b3-ac5d-8cb7226979ef',4,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who has a very strong character and is very different from other people','[ countable usually singular ]',null,'کسی که شخصیت بسیار قوی دارد و با دیگران بسیار متفاوت است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a strong personality Mercer has a strong personality and always tells you his opinion.','a forceful personality The architect’s forceful personality ensured that the work progressed rapidly.','a dominant personality (= controlling other people ) He had a dominant personality and could be a bit of a bully.','a warm personality (= friendly and kind to people ) Everyone who knew Roseanne will miss her warm personality.','an outgoing/extrovert personality (= liking to talk to people ) The job requires someone with an outgoing personality.','an engaging personality (= pleasant, so that people like you ) He is strikingly handsome with a very engaging personality.','a bubbly personality (= happy and eager to do things ) Her bright and bubbly personality made her one of the most popular girls in her year.','a lively/vivacious personality (= liking to meet and talk to people ) Her lively personality won her many admirers.','a charismatic personality (= strong and attractive, so that people admire and respect you ) Like many other people, I was attracted by his charismatic personality.','a personality trait formal (= a part of your personality ) She shares many of her mother’s personality traits.','a personality disorder (= a mental illness affecting someone’s personality ) The hospital treats patients with severe personality disorders.','a personality clash (= when people cannot work together because they are so different ) The band eventually split because of personality clashes.','a personality test Employers are increasingly using personality tests to help them select staff.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He was a dynamic personality in the business world.","translation":"او شخصیتی پویا در دنیای تجارت بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001584566.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('e3f7ed56-bc9f-5364-8984-80e8b19652d2','e5db5bca-82b2-50b3-ac5d-8cb7226979ef',5,null,null,'spoken & written','the qualities which make a place or thing different and interesting','[ countable usually singular ]',null,'ویژگی هایی که یک مکان یا چیز را متفاوت و جالب می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a strong personality Mercer has a strong personality and always tells you his opinion.','a forceful personality The architect’s forceful personality ensured that the work progressed rapidly.','a dominant personality (= controlling other people ) He had a dominant personality and could be a bit of a bully.','a warm personality (= friendly and kind to people ) Everyone who knew Roseanne will miss her warm personality.','an outgoing/extrovert personality (= liking to talk to people ) The job requires someone with an outgoing personality.','an engaging personality (= pleasant, so that people like you ) He is strikingly handsome with a very engaging personality.','a bubbly personality (= happy and eager to do things ) Her bright and bubbly personality made her one of the most popular girls in her year.','a lively/vivacious personality (= liking to meet and talk to people ) Her lively personality won her many admirers.','a charismatic personality (= strong and attractive, so that people admire and respect you ) Like many other people, I was attracted by his charismatic personality.','a personality trait formal (= a part of your personality ) She shares many of her mother’s personality traits.','a personality disorder (= a mental illness affecting someone’s personality ) The hospital treats patients with severe personality disorders.','a personality clash (= when people cannot work together because they are so different ) The band eventually split because of personality clashes.','a personality test Employers are increasingly using personality tests to help them select staff.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s partly the architecture which gives the town its personality.","translation":"این تا حدودی معماری است که به شهر شخصیت می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000353346.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('5de06ebf-8518-5cd9-8b3f-8b2197a1a06e','b3e9ba92-bdb0-5657-a49f-acbe729813fe',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a way of thinking about something, especially one which is influenced by the type of person you are or by your experiences','[ countable ]',null,'منظر، دیدگاه؛ پرسپکتیو (نقاشی)؛ چشم‌انداز','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a new/different perspective I like the programme because it gives you a different perspective on world news.','a fresh perspective (= new and interesting or useful ) The venture will benefit from their fresh perspective.','a wider/broader perspective Searching through a variety of sources will give them a wider perspective on their subject.','a historical perspective It is important to have a historical perspective when considering these changes.','a global/international perspective A global perspective allows firms to spot opportunities and reduce supply costs.','a feminist perspective If you look at this from a feminist perspective, things are, in fact, not equal.','a female perspective Carson''s lyrics are definitely written from the human experience, but from a female perspective.','a Marxist perspective From a Marxist perspective, crime is largely the product of capitalism.','a Christian perspective We approach the problem from a Christian perspective.','a business perspective I think it was a good thing to do, from a business perspective.','the American/Russian/French etc perspective From the French perspective, therefore, 1934 marks a major turning point.','have a perspective Everyone seems to have a different perspective on the issue.','see/view something from a perspective A child can only see see the world from his or her own perspective.','give (somebody) a perspective A break might give her a better perspective on things.','provide a perspective Their research is concerned with providing an alternative perspective on our past.','offer a perspective Bamford offers a fresh perspective on this ongoing historical debate.','get a perspective When you get to my age, you get a different perspective on life.','put a perspective on something This new evidence put a whole new perspective on the case.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"His father’s death gave him a whole new perspective on life.","translation":"مرگ پدرش به او دیدگاه جدیدی نسبت به زندگی داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000353563.mp3"},{"sentence":"The novel is written from a child’s perspective.","translation":"این رمان از منظر کودک نوشته شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000353566.mp3"},{"sentence":"We have to look at everything from an international perspective.","translation":"ما باید به همه چیز از منظر بین المللی نگاه کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000353569.mp3"},{"sentence":"a much-needed historical perspective","translation":"دیدگاه تاریخی بسیار مورد نیاز","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001584619.mp3"},{"sentence":"Our work in Uganda and Romania adds a wider perspective.","translation":"کار ما در اوگاندا و رومانی چشم انداز وسیع تری می افزاید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001584624.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('053e1c10-e560-549e-8e86-fc0dff0c24e1','b3e9ba92-bdb0-5657-a49f-acbe729813fe',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a sensible way of judging and comparing situations so that you do not imagine that something is more serious than it really is','[ uncountable ]',null,'روشی معقول برای قضاوت و مقایسه موقعیت ها به طوری که تصور نکنید چیزی جدی تر از آن چیزی است که واقعاً هست','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I think Viv’s lost all sense of perspective .","translation":"من فکر می کنم که Viv تمام حس دیدگاه خود را از دست داده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000353574.mp3"},{"sentence":"The figures have to be put into perspective .","translation":"ارقام را باید در چشم انداز قرار داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001584630.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('3d26f8e1-fd35-54bf-9497-eaa4f1de020d','b3e9ba92-bdb0-5657-a49f-acbe729813fe',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a method of drawing a picture that makes objects look solid and shows distance and depth , or the effect this method produces in a picture','[ uncountable ]',null,'روشی برای کشیدن یک تصویر که اشیا را جامد نشان می دهد و فاصله و عمق را نشان می دهد یا اثری که این روش در یک تصویر ایجاد می کند.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the artist’s use of perspective","translation":"استفاده هنرمند از دیدگاه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000353582.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('e38c6c26-8748-51d3-a3b7-086b6e90f99e','b3e9ba92-bdb0-5657-a49f-acbe729813fe',4,null,null,'formal','a view , especially one in which you can see a long way into the distance','[ countable ]',null,'منظره ای، به خصوص منظره ای که در آن می توانید راه طولانی را به دوردست ببینید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('665c3b4f-2f04-5d0f-90cd-e24bee22aac4','c43e0603-042e-5a26-acd8-3b591116112c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','if there is a possibility that something is true or that something will happen, it might be true or it might happen','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'احتمال، امکان؛ احتمال (رخداد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a strong/good possibility (= something that is very likely ) There is a strong possibility that the drug causes similar damage in humans.','a real possibility (= something that is quite likely ) At this moment, a recession is a real possibility.','a distinct possibility (= something that is quite likely ) I knew there was a distinct possibility that I might fail my degree.','a remote/faint possibility (= something that is not very likely ) There''s no point worrying about such a remote possibility.','a possibility exists The possibility exists that he misunderstood the data.','something remains a possibility War remains a possibility.','consider a possibility Police in Glasgow are considering the possibility that the death may be drug-related.','raise a possibility (= say or show that something may happen or may be true ) The government has raised the possibility of an early election next year.','rule out/exclude a possibility (= say that something will definitely not happen or is definitely not true ) We can''t rule out the possibility that there will be more redundancies.','there is a possibility that There is a possibility that files could be lost if the system crashes.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There’s always a possibility that he might go back to Seattle.","translation":"همیشه این احتمال وجود دارد که او به سیاتل بازگردد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000312657.mp3"},{"sentence":"the possibility of an enemy attack","translation":"احتمال حمله دشمن","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000312649.mp3"},{"sentence":"There was no possibility of changing the voting procedure.","translation":"امکان تغییر روش رای گیری وجود نداشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001576707.mp3"},{"sentence":"A peace settlement now looks like a real possibility .","translation":"حل و فصل صلح اکنون یک امکان واقعی به نظر می رسد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000312653.mp3"},{"sentence":"Tomorrow, there’s a remote possibility of snow on high ground.","translation":"فردا در ارتفاعات احتمال بارش برف وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001763464.mp3"},{"sentence":"They might get married – it’s not beyond the bounds of possibility .","translation":"آنها ممکن است ازدواج کنند - این فراتر از حد امکان نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001576716.mp3"},{"sentence":"The study raises the possibility that dieting is bad for your health.","translation":"این مطالعه این احتمال را افزایش می دهد که رژیم غذایی برای سلامتی مضر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001942050.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('284e30de-45f9-5ff3-8fe0-08d9708ec40f','c43e0603-042e-5a26-acd8-3b591116112c',2,null,null,'spoken & written','an opportunity to do something, or something that can be done or tried','[ countable usually plural ]',null,'فرصتی برای انجام کاری، یا کاری که می توان انجام داد یا امتحان کرد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"exciting possibilities for reducing costs","translation":"امکانات هیجان انگیز برای کاهش هزینه ها","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001576726.mp3"},{"sentence":"Archer began to explore the possibilities of opening a club in the city.","translation":"آرچر شروع به بررسی احتمالات افتتاح یک باشگاه در شهر کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001576727.mp3"},{"sentence":"The US has not yet exhausted all diplomatic possibilities (= tried everything possible ) .","translation":"ایالات متحده هنوز تمام امکانات دیپلماتیک را به پایان نرسانده است (= همه چیز ممکن را امتحان کرده است).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001576731.mp3"},{"sentence":"the range of possibilities offered to students","translation":"طیف وسیعی از امکانات ارائه شده به دانش آموزان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001842948.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
