('a29516e7-f958-595f-a583-9d0830740c61','7a167587-5766-55a5-b76e-d7da40630861',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a rule or law that limits or controls what people can do','[ countable ]',null,'محدودیت، محدودسازی؛ محدودیت (حس)؛ مقید (قانون)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['put/place restrictions on something The authorities placed strict restrictions on diamond exports.','impose restrictions formal (= put restrictions on something ) Some countries have imposed restrictions on advertising aimed at children.','introduce restrictions Nine other states now plan to introduce similar restrictions.','lift/remove restrictions He promised to lift restrictions on press freedom.','tighten restrictions (= make them stricter ) The government recently tightened restrictions on police use of firearms.','relax/ease restrictions (= make them less strict ) There are restrictions on travel to Cuba by American citizens.','a restriction applies to somebody/something These travel restrictions don’t apply to tourists.','severe/strict restrictions The regime had put severe restrictions upon the media.','tough restrictions (= strict ) He called for tougher restrictions on contributions to political parties.','petty restrictions (= that seem unreasonable and unnecessary ) The removal of petty restrictions has made it much easier to do business.','speed restrictions Drivers are ignoring speed restrictions.','an age restriction Employers can no longer place age restrictions on applicants.','trade restrictions (= on the sale of goods between countries ) Trade restrictions between the islands were removed.','import/export restrictions (= trade restrictions ) Import restrictions on manufactured goods have been lifted.','travel restrictions The Home Secretary placed travel restrictions on supporters with convictions for violence.','planning restrictions (= legal restrictions on what buildings can be built somewhere ) There are government proposals to relax planning restrictions on green belt areas around cities.','parking restrictions Are there parking restrictions in the city centre?']::text[],'[{"sentence":"restrictions on immigration","translation":"محدودیت های مهاجرت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000746815.mp3"},{"sentence":"a 50 mph speed restriction","translation":"محدودیت سرعت 50 مایل در ساعت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001773349.mp3"},{"sentence":"The law imposed new financial restrictions on private companies.","translation":"این قانون محدودیت های مالی جدیدی را برای شرکت های خصوصی اعمال کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000746818.mp3"},{"sentence":"tougher restrictions on alcohol advertising","translation":"محدودیت های شدیدتر برای تبلیغات مشروبات الکلی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001876945.mp3"},{"sentence":"Restrictions on trade were lifted.","translation":"محدودیت های تجارت برداشته شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000746822.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('bb16c71e-1631-5f4d-905e-52bac815a1df','7a167587-5766-55a5-b76e-d7da40630861',2,null,null,'spoken & written','when you restrict the size , amount, or range of something','[ uncountable ]',null,'وقتی اندازه، مقدار یا محدوده چیزی را محدود می کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['put/place restrictions on something The authorities placed strict restrictions on diamond exports.','impose restrictions formal (= put restrictions on something ) Some countries have imposed restrictions on advertising aimed at children.','introduce restrictions Nine other states now plan to introduce similar restrictions.','lift/remove restrictions He promised to lift restrictions on press freedom.','tighten restrictions (= make them stricter ) The government recently tightened restrictions on police use of firearms.','relax/ease restrictions (= make them less strict ) There are restrictions on travel to Cuba by American citizens.','a restriction applies to somebody/something These travel restrictions don’t apply to tourists.','severe/strict restrictions The regime had put severe restrictions upon the media.','tough restrictions (= strict ) He called for tougher restrictions on contributions to political parties.','petty restrictions (= that seem unreasonable and unnecessary ) The removal of petty restrictions has made it much easier to do business.','speed restrictions Drivers are ignoring speed restrictions.','an age restriction Employers can no longer place age restrictions on applicants.','trade restrictions (= on the sale of goods between countries ) Trade restrictions between the islands were removed.','import/export restrictions (= trade restrictions ) Import restrictions on manufactured goods have been lifted.','travel restrictions The Home Secretary placed travel restrictions on supporters with convictions for violence.','planning restrictions (= legal restrictions on what buildings can be built somewhere ) There are government proposals to relax planning restrictions on green belt areas around cities.','parking restrictions Are there parking restrictions in the city centre?']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('99b14099-bb1d-55a3-b537-263d11937133','16248d21-470d-5359-a629-06a86ebcb4a6',1,null,null,'spoken & written','having an important effect or influence , especially on what will happen in the future',null,null,'مهم، قابل‌توجه؛ مهم (تأثیر)؛ برجسته (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"His most significant political achievement was the abolition of the death penalty.","translation":"مهمترین دستاورد سیاسی او لغو مجازات اعدام بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000685502.mp3"},{"sentence":"Please inform us if there are any significant changes in your plans.","translation":"لطفاً در صورتی که تغییرات مهمی در برنامه های شما وجود دارد به ما اطلاع دهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000685503.mp3"},{"sentence":"The result is highly significant for the future of the province.","translation":"نتیجه برای آینده استان بسیار مهم است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000685510.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is significant that the writers of the report were all men.","translation":"قابل توجه است که نویسندگان گزارش همگی مرد بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000685513.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('66e896b5-57b1-54c6-a4c6-f4fb8a12feda','16248d21-470d-5359-a629-06a86ebcb4a6',2,null,null,'spoken & written','large enough to be noticeable or have noticeable effects',null,null,'به اندازه ای بزرگ است که قابل توجه باشد یا اثرات قابل توجهی داشته باشد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A significant number of drivers fail to keep to speed limits.","translation":"تعداد قابل توجهی از رانندگان از رعایت محدودیت های سرعت کوتاهی می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000685517.mp3"},{"sentence":"A significant part of Japan’s wealth is invested in the West.","translation":"بخش قابل توجهی از ثروت ژاپن در غرب سرمایه گذاری می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001775207.mp3"},{"sentence":"There is a significant difference between the number of home births now and ten years ago.","translation":"تفاوت قابل توجهی بین تعداد تولدهای خانگی در حال حاضر و ده سال پیش وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001775208.mp3"},{"sentence":"The rise in temperature is not statistically significant .","translation":"افزایش دما از نظر آماری معنی دار نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001672776.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('697b139e-95cf-5784-88a8-9439a2df99be','16248d21-470d-5359-a629-06a86ebcb4a6',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a significant look, smile etc has a special meaning that is not known to everyone',null,null,'نگاه مهم، لبخند و غیره معنای خاصی دارد که برای همه شناخته شده نیست','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He gave me a significant look.","translation":"او نگاه قابل توجهی به من کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000685522.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ebc13277-1b4b-529a-b1f2-4114e414eed4','6797f342-905c-52cd-b2e2-e6a28b700d2b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','large in amount or number',null,null,'چشمگیر، قابل‌توجه (مقدار)؛ جدی (سهم)',array['considerable']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We have the support of a substantial number of parents.","translation":"ما از حمایت تعداد قابل توجهی از والدین برخورداریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743032.mp3"},{"sentence":"a substantial salary","translation":"حقوق قابل توجهی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743033.mp3"},{"sentence":"a substantial breakfast","translation":"یک صبحانه قابل توجه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743034.mp3"},{"sentence":"The document requires substantial changes.","translation":"سند نیاز به تغییرات اساسی دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000626822.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('574b3d08-b498-562a-aa39-af6229bcefec','6797f342-905c-52cd-b2e2-e6a28b700d2b',2,null,null,'spoken & written','large and strongly made','[ only before noun ]',null,'بزرگ و قوی ساخته شده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a substantial piece of furniture","translation":"یک قطعه مبلمان قابل توجه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000626832.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
