('754fd799-be4d-5015-a7ef-79a47439f039','05caedb4-1af1-5525-af77-8f342ac9d0f8',4,null,null,'spoken & written','the temperature of a situation is the way people are reacting , for example whether they are behaving angrily or calmly','[ countable ]',null,'دمای یک موقعیت نحوه واکنش افراد است، برای مثال اینکه آیا آنها با عصبانیت یا آرام رفتار می کنند.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['high At high temperatures water is not able to hold as much oxygen.','low Temperatures were so low most plants could not survive.','constant The temperature of the room is kept constant.','extreme temperatures The material has to be able to withstand extreme temperatures.','sub-zero temperatures They spent six hours on the mountain in sub-zero temperatures.','the air/water temperature The water temperature should be between 60 and 65°F.','somebody''s body temperature His body temperature was high and he was dehydrated.','a rise in temperature/a temperature rise The result was a rise in the Earth''s temperature.','a drop/fall in temperature At night there is a dramatic drop in temperature.','a change in temperature The oil is affected by changes in temperature.','at room temperature Store the wine at room temperature.','the temperature rises The temperature rose steadily throughout the morning.','the temperature soars (= rises quickly to a high level ) In summer the temperature can soar to over 40°C (104°F).','the temperature falls/drops Last winter, the temperature fell below freezing on only five days.','raise the temperature The thermostat allows you to raise the temperature.','lower the temperature Paracetomol lowers your body temperature.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The referee’s decision to give a penalty raised the temperature of the match.","translation":"تصمیم داور برای زدن پنالتی دمای مسابقه را بالا برد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002089701.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('079ec1fe-f819-50db-ac64-9d2137232c0f','4908aabd-928e-5d3f-bbcf-383c41033546',1,null,null,'spoken & written','relating to the study of ideas, especially scientific ideas, rather than to practical uses of the ideas or practical experience',null,null,'نظری، تئوریک؛ تئوری (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"theoretical physics","translation":"فیزیک نظری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000594583.mp3"},{"sentence":"Aristotle’s theoretical model of the universe","translation":"مدل نظری ارسطو از جهان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001629133.mp3"},{"sentence":"She has theoretical knowledge of teaching, but no practical experience.","translation":"او دانش تئوری تدریس دارد، اما تجربه عملی ندارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001629134.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('b70072e4-b2e4-5233-86d0-8db6305706fa','4908aabd-928e-5d3f-bbcf-383c41033546',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a theoretical situation or condition could exist but does not really exist',null,null,'یک موقعیت یا شرایط نظری می تواند وجود داشته باشد اما واقعا وجود ندارد',array['hypothetical']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Equality between men and women in our society is still only theoretical.","translation":"برابری زن و مرد در جامعه ما هنوز فقط به صورت نظری است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000594593.mp3"},{"sentence":"a theoretical risk of an explosion","translation":"خطر نظری انفجار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000594594.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
