('74ab139c-b8fe-581c-a9ba-73ad49fb6e9f','d4e2d1bc-63b8-51f1-abe0-69f69b7778f4',3,null,null,'written','the act of championing something or someone','[ uncountable + of ]',null,'عمل حمایت از چیزی یا کسی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the world championship 29 nations competed in the world championship.','the national championship the Canadian National Championship','the British/European etc championship The team failed to qualify for the European Championship.','an international championship It was the final game of the international championship.','a golf/swimming/tennis championship the Women''s Golf Championship','the League championship (= for a particular group of teams or players ) the Football League Championship','win/take the championship He won three national championships at Oklahoma.','lose the championship We lost the championship on the last day.','hold the championship The championships are being held next Sunday at the San Jose Arena.','a championship takes place The world indoor athletics championships took place in Canada.','a championship game/match He was playing in his first championship game of the season.','a championship race She was well ahead in the championship race.','a championship series (= a number of competitions ) the American League Championship series','the championship finals His team lost in the European Championship Finals.','a championship title (= the position of being the champion in a sports competition ) He''s trying to hold onto his world championship title.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('46411961-730e-586b-95a2-4ebac1c82159','0a7a0055-c312-5ed8-932c-0ec05c52bb0b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to describe the qualities of someone or something in a particular way',null,null,'مشخصه‌سازی کردن، وصف کردن؛ تمایز بخشیدن',array['portray']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The group was characterized as being well-educated and liberal.","translation":"این گروه به عنوان افرادی باسواد و لیبرال شناخته می شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000880422.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('67db9245-7bad-58a1-b801-d96d2de692ae','0a7a0055-c312-5ed8-932c-0ec05c52bb0b',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to be typical of a person, place, or thing',null,null,'معمولی بودن برای یک شخص، مکان یا چیز','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Bright colours characterize his paintings.","translation":"رنگ های روشن مشخصه نقاشی های او هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000880415.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('b5f6d06a-0906-5be5-89d0-96b7614739f4','ba26ec9c-de5f-5ed3-8e67-bfd4b27f4826',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the conditions that affect a situation, action, event etc','[ countable usually plural ]',null,'موقعیت، شرایط؛ اوضاع، احوال','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['in/under certain circumstances (= if particular conditions exist ) In certain circumstances you may be refused a visa.','exceptional/special circumstances The court may allow this evidence in exceptional circumstances.','normal circumstances In normal circumstances, a child’s language will develop naturally.','particular circumstances (= special or specific ) There may be particular circumstances in which this rule will not apply.','difficult circumstances Many teachers are doing a very good job under difficult circumstances.','suspicious circumstances (= making you think something illegal has happened ) Officers said there were no suspicious circumstances surrounding his death.','mysterious circumstances (= strange or suspicious ) One of their colleagues had vanished in mysterious circumstances.','unusual circumstances There were several unusual circumstances that night.','unforeseen circumstances (= that you did not realize would happen ) The tragedy was the result of a series of unforeseen circumstances.','tragic circumstances (= extremely sad and unfortunate ) Both parents had died in tragic circumstances.','extenuating/mitigating circumstances (= conditions that make it reasonable for someone to break the rules or law ) Hunger and poverty are not treated by the courts as extenuating circumstances.','a set/combination of circumstances This was a very unusual set of circumstances.','the circumstances surrounding something Police are investigating the circumstances surrounding the accident.','due to circumstances beyond somebody’s control Occasionally flights are cancelled due to circumstances beyond our control.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The Soviet Union had been forced by circumstances to sign a pact with Nazi Germany.","translation":"اتحاد جماهیر شوروی به دلیل شرایط مجبور به امضای پیمانی با آلمان نازی شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001694231.mp3"},{"sentence":"I can’t imagine a circumstance in which I would be willing to steal.","translation":"نمی توانم شرایطی را تصور کنم که در آن حاضر به سرقت باشم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001694232.mp3"},{"sentence":"The rules can only be waived in exceptional circumstances.","translation":"قوانین فقط در شرایط استثنایی قابل چشم پوشی هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001078067.mp3"},{"sentence":"Prisoners can only leave their cells under certain circumstances.","translation":"زندانیان تنها در شرایط خاصی می توانند سلول های خود را ترک کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001694238.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('75c8d493-255d-52b3-a290-ddb380ff54d5','ba26ec9c-de5f-5ed3-8e67-bfd4b27f4826',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'under no circumstances','موقعیت، شرایط؛ اوضاع، احوال','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['in/under certain circumstances (= if particular conditions exist ) In certain circumstances you may be refused a visa.','exceptional/special circumstances The court may allow this evidence in exceptional circumstances.','normal circumstances In normal circumstances, a child’s language will develop naturally.','particular circumstances (= special or specific ) There may be particular circumstances in which this rule will not apply.','difficult circumstances Many teachers are doing a very good job under difficult circumstances.','suspicious circumstances (= making you think something illegal has happened ) Officers said there were no suspicious circumstances surrounding his death.','mysterious circumstances (= strange or suspicious ) One of their colleagues had vanished in mysterious circumstances.','unusual circumstances There were several unusual circumstances that night.','unforeseen circumstances (= that you did not realize would happen ) The tragedy was the result of a series of unforeseen circumstances.','tragic circumstances (= extremely sad and unfortunate ) Both parents had died in tragic circumstances.','extenuating/mitigating circumstances (= conditions that make it reasonable for someone to break the rules or law ) Hunger and poverty are not treated by the courts as extenuating circumstances.','a set/combination of circumstances This was a very unusual set of circumstances.','the circumstances surrounding something Police are investigating the circumstances surrounding the accident.','due to circumstances beyond somebody’s control Occasionally flights are cancelled due to circumstances beyond our control.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
