('70a00c01-a504-5b87-8bca-ed76c8519c2d','ae5e6d10-3d23-59d7-adf1-0351d504ff57',1,null,null,'spoken & written','belonging to the present time',null,null,'معاصر، هم‌زمان (با)، امروزی',array['modern']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['contemporary art/music/dance Each year there is a contemporary music festival in November.','contemporary artists/writers Paintings by contemporary artists covered the walls.','contemporary society What is the role of television in contemporary society?','the contemporary world The environment is a major issue in the contemporary world.','contemporary life the complexity of contemporary life','contemporary Britain/America etc The book moves from the late 19th century to contemporary America.','contemporary culture/science etc Science is an important part of contemporary culture.','contemporary issues (= subjects or problems that a lot of people are talking about ) contemporary issues such as transport and pollution']::text[],'[{"sentence":"an exhibition of contemporary Japanese prints","translation":"نمایشگاهی از چاپ های معاصر ژاپن","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000859362.mp3"},{"sentence":"life in contemporary Britain","translation":"زندگی در بریتانیای معاصر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001685447.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('08b9df5f-3a4b-5a62-be35-74537038e86e','ae5e6d10-3d23-59d7-adf1-0351d504ff57',2,null,null,'spoken & written','happening or done in the same period of time',null,null,'در همان بازه زمانی اتفاق می افتد یا انجام می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['contemporary art/music/dance Each year there is a contemporary music festival in November.','contemporary artists/writers Paintings by contemporary artists covered the walls.','contemporary society What is the role of television in contemporary society?','the contemporary world The environment is a major issue in the contemporary world.','contemporary life the complexity of contemporary life','contemporary Britain/America etc The book moves from the late 19th century to contemporary America.','contemporary culture/science etc Science is an important part of contemporary culture.','contemporary issues (= subjects or problems that a lot of people are talking about ) contemporary issues such as transport and pollution']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The wall hangings are thought to be roughly contemporary with the tiled floors.","translation":"گمان می‌رود که دیوارپوش‌ها تقریباً معاصر کف‌های کاشی‌کاری شده باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001685450.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ba5bd1a9-8ace-5a2e-b4f1-fc84da3d37dc','0959d18a-e108-578a-a9aa-82c0ad118f51',1,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who lived or was in a particular place at the same time as someone else',null,null,'کسی که همزمان با شخص دیگری در یک مکان خاص زندگی کرده یا بوده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Oswald was much admired by his contemporaries at the Academy.","translation":"اسوالد توسط معاصرانش در آکادمی بسیار تحسین شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000859375.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ce7c38da-1652-5929-ade8-6733736c1faf','a36db6ce-f346-5a07-9ddb-859f216aa513',1,null,null,'spoken & written','something that you give or do in order to help something be successful','[ countable ]',null,'مشارکت، سهم؛ کمک (به)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a contribution I’d like everyone to make a contribution towards the discussion.','acknowledge/recognize somebody’s contribution (= say that you are grateful for what someone has done ) He acknowledged the contribution of many individuals in developing the report.','value somebody’s contribution (= think that someone’s contribution is important ) They didn’t seem to value my contribution.','a major/great contribution Tourism makes a major contribution to the local economy.','a positive contribution We want kids to grow up to make a positive contribution to society.','a huge contribution This player has made a huge contribution to our club.','a significant/important contribution All of you can make a significant contribution to the organization.','a useful/valuable contribution I joined the society because I felt I could make a useful contribution.','an invaluable/outstanding contribution (= extremely useful ) He won the award for his outstanding contribution over many years.','a vital contribution (= a very important one ) Volunteers make a vital contribution in this country.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Einstein was awarded the Nobel Prize for his contribution to Quantum Theory.","translation":"اینشتین به دلیل کمک به نظریه کوانتومی جایزه نوبل را دریافت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000860536.mp3"},{"sentence":"The school sees its job as preparing students to make a contribution to society.","translation":"مدرسه وظیفه خود را آماده کردن دانش آموزان برای مشارکت در جامعه می داند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000860539.mp3"},{"sentence":"Wolko made outstanding contributions to children’s medicine.","translation":"ولکو کمک های برجسته ای به پزشکی کودکان کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747229.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('043d3f5d-cdc4-51af-a20a-4273e6a13c74','a36db6ce-f346-5a07-9ddb-859f216aa513',2,null,null,'spoken & written','an amount of money that you give in order to help pay for something','[ countable ]',null,'مقدار پولی که برای کمک به پرداخت چیزی می دهید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a contribution I’d like everyone to make a contribution towards the discussion.','acknowledge/recognize somebody’s contribution (= say that you are grateful for what someone has done ) He acknowledged the contribution of many individuals in developing the report.','value somebody’s contribution (= think that someone’s contribution is important ) They didn’t seem to value my contribution.','a major/great contribution Tourism makes a major contribution to the local economy.','a positive contribution We want kids to grow up to make a positive contribution to society.','a huge contribution This player has made a huge contribution to our club.','a significant/important contribution All of you can make a significant contribution to the organization.','a useful/valuable contribution I joined the society because I felt I could make a useful contribution.','an invaluable/outstanding contribution (= extremely useful ) He won the award for his outstanding contribution over many years.','a vital contribution (= a very important one ) Volunteers make a vital contribution in this country.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a campaign contribution","translation":"مشارکت در کمپین","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747230.mp3"},{"sentence":"A contribution of £25 will buy 15 books.","translation":"با کمک 25 پوندی، 15 کتاب خریداری می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747233.mp3"},{"sentence":"Contributions to charities are tax deductible.","translation":"کمک به موسسات خیریه کسر مالیات است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000860546.mp3"},{"sentence":"You can make annual contributions of up to $1,000 in education savings accounts.","translation":"شما می توانید سالانه تا 1000 دلار در حساب های پس انداز آموزش و پرورش مشارکت داشته باشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000860549.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('869e3d6b-2f2d-5d3c-9763-d71da167f76a','a36db6ce-f346-5a07-9ddb-859f216aa513',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a regular payment that you make to your employer or to the government to pay for things that you will receive when you are no longer working, for example health care , a pension etc','[ countable ]',null,'پرداخت منظمی که به کارفرمای خود یا به دولت پرداخت می کنید تا برای چیزهایی که در زمانی که دیگر کار نمی کنید دریافت کنید، مانند مراقبت های بهداشتی، مستمری و غیره.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a contribution I’d like everyone to make a contribution towards the discussion.','acknowledge/recognize somebody’s contribution (= say that you are grateful for what someone has done ) He acknowledged the contribution of many individuals in developing the report.','value somebody’s contribution (= think that someone’s contribution is important ) They didn’t seem to value my contribution.','a major/great contribution Tourism makes a major contribution to the local economy.','a positive contribution We want kids to grow up to make a positive contribution to society.','a huge contribution This player has made a huge contribution to our club.','a significant/important contribution All of you can make a significant contribution to the organization.','a useful/valuable contribution I joined the society because I felt I could make a useful contribution.','an invaluable/outstanding contribution (= extremely useful ) He won the award for his outstanding contribution over many years.','a vital contribution (= a very important one ) Volunteers make a vital contribution in this country.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"income tax and national insurance contributions","translation":"مالیات بر درآمد و سهم بیمه ملی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747240.mp3"},{"sentence":"Have you been making regular contributions to a pension plan?","translation":"آیا به طور منظم در یک طرح بازنشستگی مشارکت داشته اید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001747243.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
