('708fca28-ba20-5316-aa3b-bb2487596939','24e09d29-d2f2-5be6-be56-608788e8bfa6',1,null,null,'spoken & written','feeling or showing a lot of interest and excitement about something',null,null,'مشتاق، باهله، پرشوق','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['be/feel enthusiastic The Irish are very enthusiastic about horse racing.','seem/appear enthusiastic I wanted to go, but Helen seemed less enthusiastic.','sound enthusiastic ‘I’m sure we can do it, ’ she said, trying to sound enthusiastic.','look enthusiastic Your husband doesn’t look too enthusiastic about the idea.','enthusiastic support His policies won him the enthusiastic support of middle-income voters.','enthusiastic supporter He is an enthusiastic supporter of the war.','enthusiastic response The proposal has received an enthusiastic response from the union.','enthusiastic reception/welcome The audience gave him an enthusiastic reception.','enthusiastic crowd/audience It’s nice to see such an enthusiastic crowd at the match.','enthusiastic applause His speech was greeted by enthusiastic applause.','an enthusiastic amateur (= someone with a fairly low level of skill who tries hard ) There are a few professionals in the race, but most are enthusiastic amateurs.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"All the staff are enthusiastic about the project.","translation":"همه کارکنان در مورد پروژه مشتاق هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001498410.mp3"},{"sentence":"The singer got an enthusiastic reception.","translation":"خواننده مورد استقبال پرشور قرار گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001498407.mp3"},{"sentence":"an enthusiastic supporter of reform","translation":"حامی پرشور اصلاحات","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001625746.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
