ercent.','the unemployment level The unemployment level among young people is rising.','unemployment figures/statistics They publish monthly unemployment figures for the UK.','an unemployment blackspot British English (= an area where there is higher unemployment than in other places ) The town became an unemployment blackspot after the factory closure.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He’s been on unemployment for two months.","translation":"او دو ماه است که بیکار است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001632319.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c666a828-e075-56e5-bec6-4f2fe664d710','f42bcc40-759e-55b5-9cf5-659c757ad6be',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a place for someone to stay , live, or work','[ uncountable ]',null,'محل اقامت، اسکان','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The price for the holiday includes flights and accommodation.","translation":"قیمت تعطیلات شامل پرواز و اقامت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001654767.mp3"},{"sentence":"living accommodations for the crews","translation":"محل اقامت برای خدمه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001833744.mp3"},{"sentence":"travel and hotel accommodations","translation":"مسافرت و اقامت در هتل","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001833745.mp3"},{"sentence":"rented accommodation","translation":"اقامتگاه اجاره ای","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000966538.mp3"},{"sentence":"secure accommodation for young offenders","translation":"اسکان امن برای مجرمان جوان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001654764.mp3"},{"sentence":"Universities have to provide student accommodation for first-year students.","translation":"دانشگاه ها باید برای دانشجویان سال اول خوابگاه دانشجویی فراهم کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001776743.mp3"},{"sentence":"She’s trying to find somewhere to live .","translation":"او در تلاش است تا جایی برای زندگی پیدا کند.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"Have you found anywhere to stay yet?","translation":"آیا هنوز جایی برای ماندن پیدا کرده اید؟","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,8),
('5dba3036-5f9c-55f5-bcdc-4e996a236d6b','f42bcc40-759e-55b5-9cf5-659c757ad6be',2,null,null,'formal','an agreement between people or groups who have different views or opinions , that satisfies everyone','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'توافقی بین افراد یا گروه‌هایی که دیدگاه‌ها یا نظرات متفاوتی دارند، که همه را راضی می‌کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We reached an accommodation between both parties.","translation":"به محل اقامتی بین دو طرف رسیدیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001654772.mp3"},{"sentence":"Neither side was willing to make any kind of accommodation.","translation":"هیچ یک از طرفین حاضر به ایجاد هیچ نوع مسکنی نبودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00012.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('83c0037a-e85b-5083-9547-0a43ad4fe0db','263c31e4-236f-568a-be98-74e5fa4a75b4',1,null,null,'informal','a picture , set of words, or a short film , which is intended to persuade people to buy a product or use a service , or that gives information about a job that is available , an event that is going to happen etc',null,null,'آگهی، اعلان تبلیغاتی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a car/holiday/shampoo etc advertisement a glossy magazine full of car advertisements','a job advertisement Jo was reading the job advertisements in the newspaper.','a newspaper/magazine advertisement I got the apartment through a newspaper advertisement.','a television/TV/Internet advertisement the new TV advertisement for the Volkswagen Golf','a full-page advertisement The organization took out a full-page advertisement in the New York Times.','a pop-up advertisement (= one that suddenly appears on your computer screen when you are looking at a website ) You can buy software that blocks unwanted pop-up advertisements.','put/place an advertisement in a paper/newspaper I tried putting an advertisement for lodgers in the local paper.','post an advertisement (= put it on a website ) The agency has posted an advertisement on its website for graduates to work overseas.','take out an advertisement (= arrange for an advertisement to be in a newspaper or magazine ) Their record company took out full-page advertisements in the music press to promote the album.','run/carry an advertisement (= print or broadcast an advertisement ) Broadcasters are no longer allowed to run cigarette advertisements.','answer an advertisement I answered an advertisement in the paper for volunteers.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The Sunday papers are full of advertisements for cars.","translation":"روزنامه های یکشنبه مملو از آگهی های اتومبیل است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001982183.mp3"},{"sentence":"She saw an advertisement for a ski vacation in Vermont.","translation":"او یک تبلیغ برای تعطیلات اسکی در ورمونت دید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000793591.mp3"},{"sentence":"They put an advertisement in ‘The Morning News’, offering a high salary for the right person.","translation":"آنها یک آگهی در \"اخبار صبح\" گذاشتند و حقوق بالایی را برای شخص مناسب ارائه کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001982184.mp3"},{"sentence":"The organizers of the concert had taken out a full page advertisement in ‘The New York Times’.","translation":"برگزارکنندگان کنسرت یک آگهی تمام صفحه در «نیویورک تایمز» منتشر کرده بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001982188.mp3"},{"sentence":"Only a handful of people answered the advertisement .","translation":"فقط تعداد انگشت شماری به آگهی پاسخ دادند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001982194.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('083a3bf5-8b90-5bdb-ba81-3ddbe365f7ad','263c31e4-236f-568a-be98-74e5fa4a75b4',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be an advertisement for something','آگهی، اعلان تبلیغاتی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a car/holiday/shampoo etc advertisement a glossy magazine full of car advertisements','a job advertisement Jo was reading the job advertisements in the newspaper.','a newspaper/magazine advertisement I got the apartment through a newspaper advertisement.','a television/TV/Internet advertisement the new TV advertisement for the Volkswagen Golf','a full-page advertisement The organization took out a full-page advertisement in the New York Times.','a pop-up advertisement (= one that suddenly appears on your computer screen when you are looking at a website ) You can buy software that blocks unwanted pop-up advertisements.','put/place an advertisement in a paper/newspaper I tried putting an advertisement for lodgers in the local paper.','post an advertisement (= put it on a website ) The agency has posted an advertisement on its website for graduates to work overseas.','take out an advertisement (= arrange for an advertisement to be in a newspaper or magazine ) Their record company took out full-page advertisements in the music press to promote the album.','run/carry an advertisement (= print or broadcast an advertisement ) Broadcasters are no longer allowed to run cigarette advertisements.','answer an advertisement I answered an advertisement in the paper for volunteers.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('3e54e5f3-fa45-5252-96ff-b1de3bc3b9ed','85a6df66-7ecf-5e8d-a413-987fde22dc3d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','as the result of a situation or action, and without you having to do anything more',null,null,'به‌طور خودکار؛ ناخواسته، ناخودآگاه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Join now and you will automatically receive 50% off your first purchase.","translation":"اکنون عضو شوید و به طور خودکار 50% تخفیف برای اولین خرید خود دریافت خواهید کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000928198.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('44198aff-7b98-56b6-be10-c97f47977afb','85a6df66-7ecf-5e8d-a413-987fde22dc3d',2,null,null,'spoken & written','without thinking about what you are doing',null,null,'بدون اینکه به کاری که انجام می دهید فکر کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Of course I automatically said yes.","translation":"البته من به طور خودکار گفتم بله.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001660386.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('35a1afdd-138d-50a2-ad38-8fbb11a79e89','85a6df66-7ecf-5e8d-a413-987fde22dc3d',3,null,null,'spoken & written','by the action of a machine , without a person making it work',null,null,'با عمل یک ماشین، بدون اینکه شخصی آن را به کار بیاندازد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The doors opened automatically as we approached.","translation":"با نزدیک شدن ما درها به طور خودکار باز شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000928202.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('7e0abf81-d068-5d73-9518-00eec2aa5e9c','2489de58-1f55-51d0-b1a2-02b7edab0350',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the process by which people exchange information or express their thoughts and feelings','[ uncountable ]',null,'ارتباطات، ارتباط؛ پیام‌رسانی؛ رسانه (مخابرات)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a means of communication (= a way of exchanging information ) There were no roads and no means of communication with the people in the mountains.','a line/channel of communication (= a way of exchanging information, especially in an organization ) It''s important to maintain good lines of communication between managers and staff.','a form/method/system of communication (= something you use to exchange information ) At university, lectures are the main form of communication.','a medium of communication (= a way of exchanging information, especially through television, art, music etc ) Photography is a very popular medium of communication.','a lack of communication Disagreements are often due to a lack of communication.','a breakdown in communication (= a failure ) Differences in language and traditions can lead to a breakdown in communication.','good communication In our company, there is good communication between the various departments.','poor communication There was poor communication between the air traffic controllers and the aircraft.','effective communication Effective communication plays a key role in the democratic process.','direct communication The new system allows more direct communication between teachers and parents.','open communication (= involving everyone in a group ) The system is aimed at creating trust and open communication.','mass communication (= involving many people in a country, the world etc ) Television, radio and other forms of mass communication have made the world a global village.','human communication Speech is the most effective method of human communication.','verbal communication (= with words ) This activity is designed to improve students'' verbal communication skills.','non-verbal communication (= without words ) Your appearance and movements are both forms of non-verbal communication.','electronic communication (= using computers ) Electronic communication encourages more information exchange.','two-way communication (= in both directions ) Train drivers need two-way communication with the signal box at all times.','establish communication My job is to establish good communication with our hotel guests.','facilitate communication (= make it easier ) Computers have facilitated global communication.','communication skills Most managers in business spend some time learning communication skills, so that they and their staff can understand each other.','a communication system The natural communication system for humans is speech.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Good communication is vital in a large organization.","translation":"ارتباطات خوب در یک سازمان بزرگ حیاتی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001096778.mp3"},{"sentence":"Radio was the pilot’s only means of communication .","translation":"رادیو تنها وسیله ارتباطی خلبان بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001669204.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('4eb1cf38-fba0-5d04-8ee8-73c62caf6496','2489de58-1f55-51d0-b1a2-02b7edab0350',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'communications','ارتباطات، ارتباط؛ پیام‌رسانی؛ رسانه (مخابرات)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('dee5200b-edab-5b71-9f81-5296b6f0a5b5','2489de58-1f55-51d0-b1a2-02b7edab0350',3,null,null,'spoken & written','the way people express themselves so that other people will understand','[ uncountable ]',null,'روشی که مردم خودشان را بیان می کنند تا دیگران بفهمند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a means of communication (= a way of exchanging information ) There were no roads and no means of communication with the people in the mountains.','a line/channel of communication (= a way of exchanging information, especially in an organization ) It''s important to maintain good lines of communication between managers and staff.','a form/method/system of communication (= something you use to exchange information ) At university, lectures are the main form of communication.','a medium of communication (= a way of exchanging information, especially through television, art, music etc ) Photography is a very popular medium of communication.','a lack of communication Disagreements are often due to a lack of communication.','a breakdown in communication (= a failure ) Differences in language and traditions can lead to a breakdown in communication.','good communication In our company, there is good communication between the various departments.','poor communication There was poor communication between the air traffic controllers and the aircraft.','effective communication Effective communication plays a key role in the democratic process.','direct communication The new system allows more direct communication between teachers and parents.','open communication (= involving everyone in a group ) The system is aimed at creating trust and open communication.','mass communication (= involving many people in a country, the world etc ) Television, radio and other forms of mass communication have made the world a global village.','human communication Speech is the most effective method of human communication.','verbal communication (= with words ) This activity is designed to improve students'' verbal communication skills.','non-verbal communication (= without words ) Your appearance and movements are both forms of non-verbal communication.','electronic communication (= using computers ) Electronic communication encourages more information exchange.','two-way communication (= in both directions ) Train drivers need two-way communication with the signal box at all times.','establish communication My job is to establish good communication with our hotel guests.','facilitate communication (= make it easier ) Computers have facilitated global communication.','communication skills Most managers in business spend some time learning communication skills, so that they and their staff can understand each other.','a communication system The natural communication system for humans is speech.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a week’s course in improving communication skills","translation":"دوره یک هفته ای بهبود مهارت های ارتباطی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001669215.mp3"},{"sentence":"There has been a breakdown in communication (= failure to communicate ) .","translation":"اختلال در ارتباطات (= عدم برقراری ارتباط) رخ داده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001669218.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('547c222e-72ce-5d0d-a057-5a7b8902b3c9','2489de58-1f55-51d0-b1a2-02b7edab0350',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be in communication with somebody','ارتباطات، ارتباط؛ پیام‌رسانی؛ رسانه (مخابرات)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('8b0a1a77-3606-56d3-a45a-3ac397331ab7','2489de58-1f55-51d0-b1a2-02b7edab0350',5,null,null,'formal','a letter , message , or telephone call','[ countable ]',null,'یک نامه، پیام یا تماس تلفنی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a communication from the Ministry of Defence","translation":"ابلاغیه وزارت دفاع","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001096802.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c542cd36-2c6f-5940-a0ce-7579f50077f8','c39ebaca-de97-55f8-a3ac-cb90d893c3dd',1,null,null,'spoken & written','including all the necessary facts , details , or problems that need to be dealt with',null,null,'فراگیر، جامع؛ (بیمه) فراگیر',array['thorough']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a comprehensive range of something The town has a comprehensive range of sporting facilities.','a comprehensive study/survey/assessment The report includes a comprehensive study of the company’s training needs.','a comprehensive account/report He wrote a fairly comprehensive account of the islands at that time.','a comprehensive guide You’ll need to have a comprehensive guide to university courses.','a comprehensive list Here is a comprehensive list of the good hotels in the area.','a comprehensive service Our professional staff provide a comprehensive service.','a comprehensive programme Your holiday will include a comprehensive programme of sightseeing trips.','a comprehensive approach He promised a comprehensive approach to health care reform.','a comprehensive picture The police still do not have a comprehensive picture of what happened.','comprehensive information The information we have is fairly comprehensive.','fully comprehensive The report does not claim to be fully comprehensive.','fairly/reasonably comprehensive The available data on world population is reasonably comprehensive.','extremely comprehensive The instruction manual is extremely comprehensive.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We offer our customers a comprehensive range of financial products.","translation":"ما به مشتریان خود طیف گسترده ای از محصولات مالی را ارائه می دهیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687827.mp3"},{"sentence":"a comprehensive guide to British hotels and restaurants","translation":"راهنمای جامع هتل ها و رستوران های بریتانیا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687831.mp3"},{"sentence":"The following guidelines do not aim to be totally comprehensive.","translation":"هدف دستورالعمل های زیر جامعیت کامل نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687835.mp3"},{"sentence":"a thorough and comprehensive review of the case","translation":"بررسی کامل و جامع پرونده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000876809.mp3"},{"sentence":"a comprehensive study of alcoholism","translation":"مطالعه جامع اعتیاد به الکل","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687836.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('78515cff-54e5-5e1f-8cec-95680baea6d1','c39ebaca-de97-55f8-a3ac-cb90d893c3dd',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'comprehensive insurance/cover/policy','فراگیر، جامع؛ (بیمه) فراگیر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a comprehensive range of something The town has a comprehensive range of sporting facilities.','a comprehensive study/survey/assessment The report includes a comprehensive study of the company’s training needs.','a comprehensive account/report He wrote a fairly comprehensive account of the islands at that time.','a comprehensive guide You’ll need to have a comprehensive guide to university courses.','a comprehensive list Here is a comprehensive list of the good hotels in the area.','a comprehensive service Our professional staff provide a comprehensive service.','a comprehensive programme Your holiday will include a comprehensive programme of sightseeing trips.','a comprehensive approach He promised a comprehensive approach to health care reform.','a comprehensive picture The police still do not have a comprehensive picture of what happened.','comprehensive information The information we have is fairly comprehensive.','fully comprehensive The report does not claim to be fully comprehensive.','fairly/reasonably comprehensive The available data on world population is reasonably comprehensive.','extremely comprehensive The instruction manual is extremely comprehensive.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('2857996d-baa0-5584-bf92-d65585d062a0','c39ebaca-de97-55f8-a3ac-cb90d893c3dd',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'comprehensive education/system','فراگیر، جامع؛ (بیمه) فراگیر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a comprehensive range of something The town has a comprehensive range of sporting facilities.','a comprehensive study/survey/assessment The report includes a comprehensive study of the company’s training needs.','a comprehensive account/report He wrote a fairly comprehensive account of the islands at that time.','a comprehensive guide You’ll need to have a comprehensive guide to university courses.','a comprehensive list Here is a comprehensive list of the good hotels in the area.','a comprehensive service Our professional staff provide a comprehensive service.','a comprehensive programme Your holiday will include a comprehensive programme of sightseeing trips.','a comprehensive approach He promised a comprehensive approach to health care reform.','a comprehensive picture The police still do not have a comprehensive picture of what happened.','comprehensive information The information we have is fairly comprehensive.','fully comprehensive The report does not claim to be fully comprehensive.','fairly/reasonably comprehensive The available data on world population is reasonably comprehensive.','extremely comprehensive The instruction manual is extremely comprehensive.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('e9a82654-3386-592e-b7fd-5eab69c54d60','44fa1552-614d-5ebf-9fca-7b1720f6c567',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the ability to think about something carefully or for a long time','[ uncountable ]',null,'تمرکز، توجه متمرکز؛ تغلیظ (محلول)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['something takes concentration (= needs concentration ) Playing a musical instrument takes a lot of concentration.','something requires/demands concentration formal Writing an exam requires great concentration.','lose (your) concentration Halfway through the game, he seemed to lose concentration.','break somebody’s concentration (= stop someone concentrating ) The telephone rang and broke my concentration.','disturb somebody’s concentration She slipped out of the room, trying not to disturb his concentration.','somebody’s powers of concentration (= someone’s ability to concentrate hard ) Great athletes are known for their powers of concentration.','a lack of concentration A lack of concentration when you are driving can be fatal.','a lapse in/of concentration (= a short time when you do not concentrate ) That brief lapse of concentration resulted in a goal for the other team.','great/deep concentration My work demands great concentration.','poor concentration The boy had behavioural problems and suffered from poor concentration.','total concentration I was impressed by her total concentration on the game.','intense concentration (= very great concentration ) The job demands intense concentration.','a concentration span (= the length of time that you are able to concentrate ) Young children have a short concentration span.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She needed all her powers of concentration to stop herself from slipping on the icy road.","translation":"او به تمام قدرت تمرکزش نیاز داشت تا از سر خوردن در جاده یخی جلوگیری کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001100212.mp3"},{"sentence":"Lack of concentration was a real problem.","translation":"عدم تمرکز یک مشکل واقعی بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687929.mp3"},{"sentence":"I lost my concentration and fell asleep.","translation":"تمرکزم را از دست دادم و خوابم برد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687930.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('253c4661-140d-5165-8603-d1363c39de5e','44fa1552-614d-5ebf-9fca-7b1720f6c567',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a process in which you put a lot of attention , energy etc into a particular activity','[ uncountable ]',null,'فرآیندی که در آن شما توجه، انرژی و غیره زیادی را به یک فعالیت خاص معطوف می‌کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['something takes concentration (= needs concentration ) Playing a musical instrument takes a lot of concentration.','something requires/demands concentration formal Writing an exam requires great concentration.','lose (your) concentration Halfway through the game, he seemed to lose concentration.','break somebody’s concentration (= stop someone concentrating ) The telephone rang and broke my concentration.','disturb somebody’s concentration She slipped out of the room, trying not to disturb his concentration.','somebody’s powers of concentration (= someone’s ability to concentrate hard ) Great athletes are known for their powers of concentration.','a lack of concentration A lack of concentration when you are driving can be fatal.','a lapse in/of concentration (= a short time when you do not concentrate ) That brief lapse of concentration resulted in a goal for the other team.','great/deep concentration My work demands great concentration.','poor concentration The boy had behavioural problems and suffered from poor concentration.','total concentration I was impressed by her total concentration on the game.','intense concentration (= very great concentration ) The job demands intense concentration.','a concentration span (= the length of time that you are able to concentrate ) Young children have a short concentration span.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"concentration on your health","translation":"روی سلامتی خود تمرکز کنید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001100219.mp3"},{"sentence":"concentration on providing value and service","translation":"تمرکز بر ارائه ارزش و خدمات","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687931.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('e1203405-1d42-5c67-b22a-75bae9173fbe','44fa1552-614d-5ebf-9fca-7b1720f6c567',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a large amount of something in a particular place or among particular people','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'مقدار زیادی از چیزی در یک مکان خاص یا در میان افراد خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['something takes concentration (= needs concentration ) Playing a musical instrument takes a lot of concentration.','something requires/demands concentration formal Writing an exam requires great concentration.','lose (your) concentration Halfway through the game, he seemed to lose concentration.','break somebody’s concentration (= stop someone concentrating ) The telephone rang and broke my concentration.','disturb somebody’s concentration She slipped out of the room, trying not to disturb his concentration.','somebody’s powers of concentration (= someone’s ability to concentrate hard ) Great athletes are known for their powers of concentration.','a lack of concentration A lack of concentration when you are driving can be fatal.','a lapse in/of concentration (= a short time when you do not concentrate ) That brief lapse of concentration resulted in a goal for the other team.','great/deep concentration My work demands great concentration.','poor concentration The boy had behavioural problems and suffered from poor concentration.','total concentration I was impressed by her total concentration on the game.','intense concentration (= very great concentration ) The job demands intense concentration.','a concentration span (= the length of time that you are able to concentrate ) Young children have a short concentration span.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the concentration of greenhouse gases in the atmosphere","translation":"غلظت گازهای گلخانه ای در جو","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001100226.mp3"},{"sentence":"the concentration of power in the hands of a few","translation":"تمرکز قدرت در دست چند نفر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687932.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('4412a9cd-24ff-5327-9b37-39ac19a4a405','44fa1552-614d-5ebf-9fca-7b1720f6c567',4,null,null,'technical','the amount of a substance contained in a liquid','[ countable ]',null,'مقدار ماده موجود در یک مایع','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['something takes concentration (= needs concentration ) Playing a musical instrument takes a lot of concentration.','something requires/demands concentration formal Writing an exam requires great concentration.','lose (your) concentration Halfway through the game, he seemed to lose concentration.','break somebody’s concentration (= stop someone concentrating ) The telephone rang and broke my concentration.','disturb somebody’s concentration She slipped out of the room, trying not to disturb his concentration.','somebody’s powers of concentration (= someone’s ability to concentrate hard ) Great athletes are known for their powers of concentration.','a lack of concentration A lack of concentration when you are driving can be fatal.','a lapse in/of concentration (= a short time when you do not concentrate ) That brief lapse of concentration resulted in a goal for the other team.','great/deep concentration My work demands great concentration.','poor concentration The boy had behavioural problems and suffered from poor concentration.','total concentration I was impressed by her total concentration on the game.','intense concentration (= very great concentration ) The job demands intense concentration.','a concentration span (= the length of time that you are able to concentrate ) Young children have a short concentration span.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Additives are expensive but are used in very low concentrations.","translation":"افزودنی ها گران هستند اما در غلظت های بسیار کم استفاده می شوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687941.mp3"},{"sentence":"allowable concentrations of pesticides in drinking water","translation":"غلظت مجاز آفت کش ها در آب آشامیدنی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687944.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('5e6b709e-cde3-5058-b0c7-6cebb18f418b','a9e4121e-ed31-5da3-a352-8b464f9e8dd1',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the condition of being awake and able to understand what is happening around you','[ uncountable ]',null,'هوشیاری، آگاهی؛ ذهن و روان','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['lose consciousness (= go into a type of deep sleep that is not normal ) As she fell, she hit her head and lost consciousness for several minutes.','regain/recover consciousness (= wake up ) I wanted to stay at the hospital until he regained consciousness.','return to consciousness When I returned to consciousness, my head was throbbing with pain.','bring somebody back to consciousness The doctors were unable to bring her back to consciousness.','drift in and out of consciousness (= be awake and then not awake, and then awake again, etc ) He had a high temperature and was drifting in and out of consciousness.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"David lost consciousness (= went into a deep sleep ) at eight o''clock and died a few hours later.","translation":"داوود در ساعت هشت از هوش رفت (= به خواب عمیقی رفت) و چند ساعت بعد درگذشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000855859.mp3"},{"sentence":"She could faintly hear voices as she began to regain consciousness (= wake up ) .","translation":"هنگامی که شروع به به هوش آمدن (= بیدار شدن) کرد، او به طور ضعیف صداهایی را می شنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000855863.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('11f4c89b-c4a4-5374-99d7-e465caed400e','a9e4121e-ed31-5da3-a352-8b464f9e8dd1',2,null,null,'spoken & written','your mind and your thoughts','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'ذهن و افکار شما','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['lose consciousness (= go into a type of deep sleep that is not normal ) As she fell, she hit her head and lost consciousness for several minutes.','regain/recover consciousness (= wake up ) I wanted to stay at the hospital until he regained consciousness.','return to consciousness When I returned to consciousness, my head was throbbing with pain.','bring somebody back to consciousness The doctors were unable to bring her back to consciousness.','drift in and out of consciousness (= be awake and then not awake, and then awake again, etc ) He had a high temperature and was drifting in and out of consciousness.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The painful memories eventually faded from her consciousness.","translation":"خاطرات دردناک در نهایت از هوشیاری او محو شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000855868.mp3"},{"sentence":"Hypnosis is an altered state of consciousness .","translation":"هیپنوتیزم یک حالت تغییر یافته هوشیاری است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675214.mp3"},{"sentence":"research into human consciousness","translation":"تحقیق در مورد آگاهی انسان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675218.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('7a0ea446-4eb3-55e2-8005-56e10f328379','a9e4121e-ed31-5da3-a352-8b464f9e8dd1',3,null,null,'spoken & written','someone’s ideas, feelings , or opinions about politics , life etc','[ countable ]',null,'عقاید، احساسات، یا عقاید کسی در مورد سیاست، زندگی و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['lose consciousness (= go into a type of deep sleep that is not normal ) As she fell, she hit her head and lost consciousness for several minutes.','regain/recover consciousness (= wake up ) I wanted to stay at the hospital until he regained consciousness.','return to consciousness When I returned to consciousness, my head was throbbing with pain.','bring somebody back to consciousness The doctors were unable to bring her back to consciousness.','drift in and out of consciousness (= be awake and then not awake, and then awake again, etc ) He had a high temperature and was drifting in and out of consciousness.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The experience helped to change her political consciousness.","translation":"این تجربه به تغییر آگاهی سیاسی او کمک کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000855873.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('a678404b-5254-57cc-982e-2c09a33cbd43','a9e4121e-ed31-5da3-a352-8b464f9e8dd1',4,null,null,'spoken & written','when you know that something exists or is true','[ uncountable ]',null,'وقتی می دانید چیزی وجود دارد یا درست است',array['awareness']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['lose consciousness (= go into a type of deep sleep that is not normal ) As she fell, she hit her head and lost consciousness for several minutes.','regain/recover consciousness (= wake up ) I wanted to stay at the hospital until he regained consciousness.','return to consciousness When I returned to consciousness, my head was throbbing with pain.','bring somebody back to consciousness The doctors were unable to bring her back to consciousness.','drift in and out of consciousness (= be awake and then not awake, and then awake again, etc ) He had a high temperature and was drifting in and out of consciousness.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"This will increase public consciousness of the pollution issue.","translation":"این امر آگاهی عمومی را نسبت به موضوع آلودگی افزایش می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000855881.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('cb775675-ddfa-5da6-956e-d204f2d23c52','e4d33a77-cf5a-5b10-93d4-666b19a6c7f3',1,null,null,'formal','careful thought and attention , especially before making an official or important decision','[ uncountable ]',null,'ملاحظه، دقت در سنجش؛ توجه؛ ملاحظات','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give something consideration It’s an interesting idea and I’ll give it some consideration.','deserve/merit consideration ( also be worthy of consideration ) He made a number of proposals that deserve consideration.','need/require consideration Money is usually the first issue that needs consideration.','receive consideration All applications for a university place receive consideration.','careful consideration After careful consideration I have decided not to accept your offer.','serious consideration At the time, I didn’t give his suggestion serious consideration.','further consideration The meeting was adjourned to allow time for further consideration.','special consideration Two other major difficulties need special consideration.','detailed consideration Each of these matters requires detailed consideration.','due/proper consideration (= the necessary and suitable consideration ) A lot of building took place without due consideration for the effect it would have on the area.','full consideration (= the highest amount of consideration ) Our decision must be based on full consideration of the long-term consequences.','urgent consideration I would be grateful if you would give this matter urgent consideration.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"proposals put forward for consideration","translation":"پیشنهادات ارائه شده برای بررسی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675522.mp3"},{"sentence":"There are several amendments under consideration.","translation":"چندین اصلاحیه در دست بررسی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675525.mp3"},{"sentence":"After due consideration, I have decided to tender my resignation.","translation":"پس از بررسی های لازم، تصمیم گرفتم استعفای خود را ارائه دهم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001105057.mp3"},{"sentence":"We would have to give serious consideration to banning it altogether.","translation":"ما باید به طور جدی به ممنوعیت آن توجه کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675526.mp3"},{"sentence":"These plans definitely merit further consideration.","translation":"این طرح ها قطعاً مستلزم بررسی بیشتر هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675529.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('b5a10459-b1fa-5fe5-a8a5-13fea562b962','e4d33a77-cf5a-5b10-93d4-666b19a6c7f3',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'take something into consideration','ملاحظه، دقت در سنجش؛ توجه؛ ملاحظات','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give something consideration It’s an interesting idea and I’ll give it some consideration.','deserve/merit consideration ( also be worthy of consideration ) He made a number of proposals that deserve consideration.','need/require consideration Money is usually the first issue that needs consideration.','receive consideration All applications for a university place receive consideration.','careful consideration After careful consideration I have decided not to accept your offer.','serious consideration At the time, I didn’t give his suggestion serious consideration.','further consideration The meeting was adjourned to allow time for further consideration.','special consideration Two other major difficulties need special consideration.','detailed consideration Each of these matters requires detailed consideration.','due/proper consideration (= the necessary and suitable consideration ) A lot of building took place without due consideration for the effect it would have on the area.','full consideration (= the highest amount of consideration ) Our decision must be based on full consideration of the long-term consequences.','urgent consideration I would be grateful if you would give this matter urgent consideration.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('8cfc31b2-13c5-5618-8adb-a378a2894672','e4d33a77-cf5a-5b10-93d4-666b19a6c7f3',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a fact that you think about when you are making a decision','[ countable ]',null,'واقعیتی که هنگام تصمیم گیری به آن فکر می کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give something consideration It’s an interesting idea and I’ll give it some consideration.','deserve/merit consideration ( also be worthy of consideration ) He made a number of proposals that deserve consideration.','need/require consideration Money is usually the first issue that needs consideration.','receive consideration All applications for a university place receive consideration.','careful consideration After careful consideration I have decided not to accept your offer.','serious consideration At the time, I didn’t give his suggestion serious consideration.','further consideration The meeting was adjourned to allow time for further consideration.','special consideration Two other major difficulties need special consideration.','detailed consideration Each of these matters requires detailed consideration.','due/proper consideration (= the necessary and suitable consideration ) A lot of building took place without due consideration for the effect it would have on the area.','full consideration (= the highest amount of consideration ) Our decision must be based on full consideration of the long-term consequences.','urgent consideration I would be grateful if you would give this matter urgent consideration.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Political rather than economic considerations influenced the location of the new factory.","translation":"ملاحظات سیاسی و نه اقتصادی بر محل کارخانه جدید تأثیر گذاشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001105072.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('f69d8497-69ed-52a2-a85b-fa2ca7375dd5','e4d33a77-cf5a-5b10-93d4-666b19a6c7f3',4,null,null,'spoken & written','the quality of thinking about other people’s feelings and being careful not to upset them','[ uncountable ]',null,'کیفیت فکر کردن به احساسات دیگران و مراقب بودن آنها را ناراحت نکنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give something consideration It’s an interesting idea and I’ll give it some consideration.','deserve/merit consideration ( also be worthy of consideration ) He made a number of proposals that deserve consideration.','need/require consideration Money is usually the first issue that needs consideration.','receive consideration All applications for a university place receive consideration.','careful consideration After careful consideration I have decided not to accept your offer.','serious consideration At the time, I didn’t give his suggestion serious consideration.','further consideration The meeting was adjourned to allow time for further consideration.','special consideration Two other major difficulties need special consideration.','detailed consideration Each of these matters requires detailed consideration.','due/proper consideration (= the necessary and suitable consideration ) A lot of building took place without due consideration for the effect it would have on the area.','full consideration (= the highest amount of consideration ) Our decision must be based on full consideration of the long-term consequences.','urgent consideration I would be grateful if you would give this matter urgent consideration.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The murdered woman’s name has not been released, out of consideration for her parents.","translation":"نام این زن مقتول به دلیل توجه والدینش فاش نشده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001105081.mp3"},{"sentence":"They’ve got no consideration for others .","translation":"آنها هیچ توجهی به دیگران ندارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675532.mp3"},{"sentence":"Show some consideration !","translation":"کمی توجه نشان دهید!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675536.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('09cb1d47-4c13-5568-bf92-f24761824530','e4d33a77-cf5a-5b10-93d4-666b19a6c7f3',5,null,null,'formal','a payment for something, especially a service','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'پرداخت برای چیزی، به ویژه یک سرویس','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give something consideration It’s an interesting idea and I’ll give it some consideration.','deserve/merit consideration ( also be worthy of consideration ) He made a number of proposals that deserve consideration.','need/require consideration Money is usually the first issue that needs consideration.','receive consideration All applications for a university place receive consideration.','careful consideration After careful consideration I have decided not to accept your offer.','serious consideration At the time, I didn’t give his suggestion serious consideration.','further consideration The meeting was adjourned to allow time for further consideration.','special consideration Two other major difficulties need special consideration.','detailed consideration Each of these matters requires detailed consideration.','due/proper consideration (= the necessary and suitable consideration ) A lot of building took place without due consideration for the effect it would have on the area.','full consideration (= the highest amount of consideration ) Our decision must be based on full consideration of the long-term consequences.','urgent consideration I would be grateful if you would give this matter urgent consideration.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I might be able to help you, for a small consideration .","translation":"شاید بتوانم برای یک ملاحظه کوچک به شما کمک کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001105107.mp3"},{"sentence":"a payment in consideration of (= as payment for ) their services","translation":"پرداختی با در نظر گرفتن (= به عنوان پرداخت برای) خدمات آنها","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675544.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('660aa121-5f12-5567-a2d7-52b1d6f85cee','898c81de-92dd-5e7e-9857-415a92808b87',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an event at which a large group of people meet to protest or to support something in public',null,null,'تظاهرات، راه‌پیمایی؛ نمایش عملی؛ اثبات','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['hold/stage a demonstration (= organize and take part in one ) In April, students began holding demonstrations to demand more freedom.','organize a demonstration A large demonstration was organized by the opposition.','take part in a demonstration ( also participate in a demonstration formal ) As many as 400,000 people took part in the demonstration.','go on a demonstration British English (= take part in a demonstration ) I''ve never been on a demonstration before.','join a demonstration They were prevented by police from joining the demonstration.','break up a demonstration (= prevent it from continuing ) Police moved in to break up the demonstration.','provoke/spark a demonstration (= cause it ) The incident sparked a demonstration of 2,000 people.','a demonstration takes place Violent street demonstrations took place in the capital.','a big/large demonstration Opponents of the new law are planning a big demonstration next week.','a huge/massive demonstration (= very big ) a series of massive demonstrations against the war','a mass demonstration (= involving a very large number of people ) There have been mass demonstrations in some American cities.','a peaceful demonstration Everyone has the right to take part in peaceful demonstrations.','a violent demonstration Nine people have been killed during violent demonstrations.','a street demonstration (= in the streets of a city ) A street demonstration completely blocked the centre of the city.','a student demonstration (= by students ) In France, student demonstrations were disrupting university teaching.','a public demonstration (= by members of the public ) A series of public demonstrations have been held in cities across the country.','a protest demonstration (= in which people protest against something ) The price increases were met by a series of strikes and protest demonstrations.','a political demonstration (= to protest about the government or a political policy ) She was arrested twice for her part in political demonstrations.','an anti-government/pro-democracy etc demonstration There have been further violent anti-government demonstrations this week.','a demonstration in support of something/somebody public demonstrations in support of the rebels','a demonstration in protest at something There were demonstrations in protest at the food shortages.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Supporters staged a demonstration outside the US embassy.","translation":"هواداران تظاهراتی را در مقابل سفارت آمریکا برگزار کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001134350.mp3"},{"sentence":"Police opened fire on a peaceful demonstration.","translation":"پلیس به یک تظاهرات مسالمت آمیز آتش گشود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001748055.mp3"},{"sentence":"a demonstration against the government’s educational policies","translation":"تظاهرات علیه سیاست های آموزشی دولت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001134347.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('225ceb00-c57c-57e0-9a1e-d661f828bb4f','898c81de-92dd-5e7e-9857-415a92808b87',2,null,null,'spoken & written','an act of explaining and showing how to do something or how something works',null,null,'عملی برای توضیح و نشان دادن نحوه انجام کاری یا نحوه عملکرد آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['hold/stage a demonstration (= organize and take part in one ) In April, students began holding demonstrations to demand more freedom.','organize a demonstration A large demonstration was organized by the opposition.','take part in a demonstration ( also participate in a demonstration formal ) As many as 400,000 people took part in the demonstration.','go on a demonstration British English (= take part in a demonstration ) I''ve never been on a demonstration before.','join a demonstration They were prevented by police from joining the demonstration.','break up a demonstration (= prevent it from continuing ) Police moved in to break up the demonstration.','provoke/spark a demonstration (= cause it ) The incident sparked a demonstration of 2,000 people.','a demonstration takes place Violent street demonstrations took place in the capital.','a big/large demonstration Opponents of the new law are planning a big demonstration next week.','a huge/massive demonstration (= very big ) a series of massive demonstrations against the war','a mass demonstration (= involving a very large number of people ) There have been mass demonstrations in some American cities.','a peaceful demonstration Everyone has the right to take part in peaceful demonstrations.','a violent demonstration Nine people have been killed during violent demonstrations.','a street demonstration (= in the streets of a city ) A street demonstration completely blocked the centre of the city.','a student demonstration (= by students ) In France, student demonstrations were disrupting university teaching.','a public demonstration (= by members of the public ) A series of public demonstrations have been held in cities across the country.','a protest demonstration (= in which people protest against something ) The price increases were met by a series of strikes and protest demonstrations.','a political demonstration (= to protest about the government or a political policy ) She was arrested twice for her part in political demonstrations.','an anti-government/pro-democracy etc demonstration There have been further violent anti-government demonstrations this week.','a demonstration in support of something/somebody public demonstrations in support of the rebels','a demonstration in protest at something There were demonstrations in protest at the food shortages.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He gave a practical demonstration of the boat’s military potential.","translation":"او یک نمایش عملی از پتانسیل نظامی قایق ارائه داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001748064.mp3"},{"sentence":"a cookery demonstration","translation":"نمایش آشپزی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001748070.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('62a6be2b-772f-54e7-8e27-2c014a985594','898c81de-92dd-5e7e-9857-415a92808b87',3,null,null,'formal','an action that proves that someone or something has a particular ability , quality , or feeling',null,null,'عملی که ثابت می کند کسی یا چیزی توانایی، کیفیت یا احساس خاصی دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['hold/stage a demonstration (= organize and take part in one ) In April, students began holding demonstrations to demand more freedom.','organize a demonstration A large demonstration was organized by the opposition.','take part in a demonstration ( also participate in a demonstration formal ) As many as 400,000 people took part in the demonstration.','go on a demonstration British English (= take part in a demonstration ) I''ve never been on a demonstration before.','join a demonstration They were prevented by police from joining the demonstration.','break up a demonstration (= prevent it from continuing ) Police moved in to break up the demonstration.','provoke/spark a demonstration (= cause it ) The incident sparked a demonstration of 2,000 people.','a demonstration takes place Violent street demonstrations took place in the capital.','a big/large demonstration Opponents of the new law are planning a big demonstration next week.','a huge/massive demonstration (= very big ) a series of massive demonstrations against the war','a mass demonstration (= involving a very large number of people ) There have been mass demonstrations in some American cities.','a peaceful demonstration Everyone has the right to take part in peaceful demonstrations.','a violent demonstration Nine people have been killed during violent demonstrations.','a street demonstration (= in the streets of a city ) A street demonstration completely blocked the centre of the city.','a student demonstration (= by students ) In France, student demonstrations were disrupting university teaching.','a public demonstration (= by members of the public ) A series of public demonstrations have been held in cities across the country.','a protest demonstration (= in which people protest against something ) The price increases were met by a series of strikes and protest demonstrations.','a political demonstration (= to protest about the government or a political policy ) She was arrested twice for her part in political demonstrations.','an anti-government/pro-democracy etc demonstration There have been further violent anti-government demonstrations this week.','a demonstration in support of something/somebody public demonstrations in support of the rebels','a demonstration in protest at something There were demonstrations in protest at the food shortages.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The high level of calls is a clear demonstration of the need for this service.","translation":"سطح بالای تماس ها نشان دهنده نیاز به این سرویس است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001830432.mp3"},{"sentence":"a physical demonstration of affection","translation":"نمایش فیزیکی محبت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001830436.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('7cb8375b-f5f1-59d9-9678-d70c906acb45','4bf9871e-fc82-5d0a-8b43-c7a8b09f65a0',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the quality of trying to do something even when it is difficult','[ uncountable ]',null,'اراده، عزم؛ تعیین‌کنندگی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have determination To become a professional musician, you need to have a lot of determination.','show determination ( also demonstrate determination formal ) From a very early age, she showed great determination.','something requires determination Success requires hard work and determination.','express your determination to do something He made a speech expressing his determination to rebuild the economy.','underline your determination to do something (= emphasize it ) The prime minister underlined his determination to keep interest rates high.','great determination She showed great determination to succeed.','fierce determination (= involving strong feelings ) They fought with fierce determination.','dogged/steely/grim determination (= very strong determination ) As a politician she was known for her dogged determination.','sheer determination (= nothing except great determination ) He had survived by sheer determination.','ruthless determination (= that involves not caring about hurting other people ) the ruthless determination of his business career','single-minded determination (= having one clear aim and working very hard to achieve it ) Whatever task he undertook was tackled with single-minded determination.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Yuri shows great determination to learn English.","translation":"یوری عزم زیادی برای یادگیری زبان انگلیسی نشان می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001138552.mp3"},{"sentence":"his dogged determination (= very strong determination ) to succeed","translation":"عزم سخت او (= عزم بسیار قوی) برای موفقیت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001138556.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('29223b04-c6b7-5ceb-b793-3c46705075fa','4bf9871e-fc82-5d0a-8b43-c7a8b09f65a0',2,null,null,'formal','the act of deciding something officially','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'تصمیم گیری رسمی برای چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have determination To become a professional musician, you need to have a lot of determination.','show determination ( also demonstrate determination formal ) From a very early age, she showed great determination.','something requires determination Success requires hard work and determination.','express your determination to do something He made a speech expressing his determination to rebuild the economy.','underline your determination to do something (= emphasize it ) The prime minister underlined his determination to keep interest rates high.','great determination She showed great determination to succeed.','fierce determination (= involving strong feelings ) They fought with fierce determination.','dogged/steely/grim determination (= very strong determination ) As a politician she was known for her dogged determination.','sheer determination (= nothing except great determination ) He had survived by sheer determination.','ruthless determination (= that involves not caring about hurting other people ) the ruthless determination of his business career','single-minded determination (= having one clear aim and working very hard to achieve it ) Whatever task he undertook was tackled with single-minded determination.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the determination of government policy","translation":"تعیین خط مشی دولت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001138563.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('d7060844-adbe-5963-8dfc-da2a7cf363c2','4bf9871e-fc82-5d0a-8b43-c7a8b09f65a0',3,null,null,'formal','the act of finding the exact level , amount , or cause of something','[ countable ]',null,'عمل یافتن سطح، مقدار یا علت دقیق چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have determination To become a professional musician, you need to have a lot of determination.','show determination ( also demonstrate determination formal ) From a very early age, she showed great determination.','something requires determination Success requires hard work and determination.','express your determination to do something He made a speech expressing his determination to rebuild the economy.','underline your determination to do something (= emphasize it ) The prime minister underlined his determination to keep interest rates high.','great determination She showed great determination to succeed.','fierce determination (= involving strong feelings ) They fought with fierce determination.','dogged/steely/grim determination (= very strong determination ) As a politician she was known for her dogged determination.','sheer determination (= nothing except great determination ) He had survived by sheer determination.','ruthless determination (= that involves not caring about hurting other people ) the ruthless determination of his business career','single-minded determination (= having one clear aim and working very hard to achieve it ) Whatever task he undertook was tackled with single-minded determination.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"accurate determination of the temperature","translation":"تعیین دقیق دما","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716589.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('e77d96d8-4d01-5e0a-a1e9-ace3d8e3421a','1d0a786e-0293-5a1e-ad71-c6c1ba864eae',1,null,null,'spoken & written','things such as films , television , performances etc that are intended to amuse or interest people','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'سرگرمی؛ پذیرایی؛ تفریح','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['live entertainment (= performed while people watch, not recorded and watched later ) There are three bars, all with live entertainment.','family entertainment (= suitable for adults and children ) The holiday village has plenty of family entertainment on offer.','mass/popular entertainment (= popular with large numbers of people ) Reality TV has been a very successful form of mass entertainment.','light entertainment (= shows etc that are funny and easy to understand rather than serious ) He believes that children can appreciate more than just light entertainment.','a day’s/afternoon’s/evening’s entertainment The evening’s entertainment concluded with a firework display.','provide entertainment Dancers and musicians were on hand to provide entertainment.','lay on/put on entertainment (= organize and provide it ) The organizers laid on some entertainment for the children.','a form of entertainment (= a type of entertainment ) video games and other modern forms of entertainment','a place of entertainment formal (= a place where people can go to enjoy entertainment ) Clubs and other places of entertainment must close by 3am.','the entertainment business/industry The union represents people who work in the entertainment industry.','entertainment value (= how enjoyable something is to watch ) The films provide great entertainment value for kids.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The town provides a wide choice of entertainment.","translation":"این شهر انتخاب گسترده ای از سرگرمی ها را فراهم می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001625685.mp3"},{"sentence":"There will be live entertainment (= performed then, not recorded ) throughout the day.","translation":"سرگرمی زنده (= پس از آن اجرا، ضبط نشده) در طول روز وجود خواهد داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001625686.mp3"},{"sentence":"The dolphins give good entertainment value (= a lot of amusement and interest ) .","translation":"دلفین ها ارزش سرگرمی خوبی می دهند (= سرگرمی و علاقه زیاد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001625697.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('c55f8eb5-dd23-5da8-91fb-388c0d6eae8e','1d0a786e-0293-5a1e-ad71-c6c1ba864eae',2,null,null,'formal','when you entertain someone at home, or for business','[ uncountable ]',null,'وقتی کسی را در خانه یا برای تجارت سرگرم می کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['live entertainment (= performed while people watch, not recorded and watched later ) There are three bars, all with live entertainment.','family entertainment (= suitable for adults and children ) The holiday village has plenty of family entertainment on offer.','mass/popular entertainment (= popular with large numbers of people ) Reality TV has been a very successful form of mass entertainment.','light entertainment (= shows etc that are funny and easy to understand rather than serious ) He believes that children can appreciate more than just light entertainment.','a day’s/afternoon’s/evening’s entertainment The evening’s entertainment concluded with a firework display.','provide entertainment Dancers and musicians were on hand to provide entertainment.','lay on/put on entertainment (= organize and provide it ) The organizers laid on some entertainment for the children.','a form of entertainment (= a type of entertainment ) video games and other modern forms of entertainment','a place of entertainment formal (= a place where people can go to enjoy entertainment ) Clubs and other places of entertainment must close by 3am.','the entertainment business/industry The union represents people who work in the entertainment industry.','entertainment value (= how enjoyable something is to watch ) The films provide great entertainment value for kids.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the entertainment of friends","translation":"سرگرمی دوستان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001498299.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('4bc609c3-8584-5253-87a1-f35e73b92af1','ef0f3216-c274-59e0-83de-c8a87f23abf2',1,null,null,'spoken & written','concerning or affecting the air, land, or water on Earth',null,null,'محیط‌زیستی، زیست‌محیطی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['environmental issues Environmental issues, such as cliff erosion and pollution, directly affect people’s lives.','environmental protection Is environmental protection more important than economic growth?','environmental damage the environmental damage caused by opencast mining','environmental pollution Power stations cause a lot of environmental pollution.','environmental problems Acid rain is one of the major environmental problems associated with burning coal.','environmental concerns Residents have raised some valid environmental concerns about the nuclear plant.','environmental awareness (= how aware people are of environmental issues ) Schools are crucial in helping to raise environmental awareness.','an environmental group a campaign by environmental groups to protect the Antarctic','the environmental movement (= all the groups concerned about the environment ) There are differences of opinion about nuclear power within the environmental movement.','the environmental impact Don’t underestimate the environmental impact logging has on the rainforest.','environmental effects The environmental effects of building the dam will be felt by generations to come.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the environmental damage caused by the chemical industry","translation":"آسیب های زیست محیطی ناشی از صنایع شیمیایی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001500251.mp3"},{"sentence":"an international meeting to discuss environmental issues","translation":"نشست بین المللی برای بحث در مورد مسائل زیست محیطی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001642076.mp3"},{"sentence":"the environmental impact of pollution from cars","translation":"اثرات زیست محیطی آلودگی خودروها","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001642077.mp3"},{"sentence":"an environmental group (= group of people who want to protect the environment )","translation":"یک گروه محیطی (= گروهی از افرادی که می خواهند از محیط زیست محافظت کنند)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001642078.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('66273b93-1803-5ed5-abb7-a417a57e19ed','ef0f3216-c274-59e0-83de-c8a87f23abf2',2,null,null,'spoken & written','concerning the people and things around you in your life, for example the buildings you use, the people you live or work with, and the general situation you are in',null,null,'در مورد افراد و چیزهای اطراف شما در زندگی شما، به عنوان مثال ساختمان هایی که استفاده می کنید، افرادی که با آنها زندگی می کنید یا کار می کنید، و وضعیت کلی که در آن هستید.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['environmental issues Environmental issues, such as cliff erosion and pollution, directly affect people’s lives.','environmental protection Is environmental protection more important than economic growth?','environmental damage the environmental damage caused by opencast mining','environmental pollution Power stations cause a lot of environmental pollution.','environmental problems Acid rain is one of the major environmental problems associated with burning coal.','environmental concerns Residents have raised some valid environmental concerns about the nuclear plant.','environmental awareness (= how aware people are of environmental issues ) Schools are crucial in helping to raise environmental awareness.','an environmental group a campaign by environmental groups to protect the Antarctic','the environmental movement (= all the groups concerned about the environment ) There are differences of opinion about nuclear power within the environmental movement.','the environmental impact Don’t underestimate the environmental impact logging has on the rainforest.','environmental effects The environmental effects of building the dam will be felt by generations to come.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"environmental risks to employees’ health","translation":"خطرات زیست محیطی برای سلامت کارکنان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001642085.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
