('10a7c6da-0e9a-595f-b97e-f92c31cd784f','105cd704-ddba-5fa4-863f-1f9e91048e1e',1,null,null,'spoken & written','if you have a qualification, you have passed an examination or course to show you have a particular level of skill or knowledge in a subject','[ countable usually plural ]',null,'مدرک، صلاحیت (حرفه)؛ درجه (کار)؛ شرایط (ایجاد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have a qualification ( also hold a qualification formal ) You don''t need to have any qualifications for this job.','lack qualifications 40 percent of the prisoners lack any qualifications.','get a qualification British English ( also gain/obtain a qualification formal ) I want to get the qualifications so that I can become a doctor.','academic qualifications Eva had excellent academic qualifications.','educational qualifications Too many children leave school without any educational qualifications.','a teaching/medical/legal etc qualification British English: She has a degree and a teaching qualification.','a professional qualification British English (= one relating to a professional job, such as a teacher, lawyer etc ) A professional qualification in accountancy would be an advantage.','a vocational qualification British English (= one relating to a skilled job, such as a nurse or a builder ) You can study for a vocational qualification in the tourism industry.','formal qualifications (= official qualifications rather than experience ) He has no formal qualifications.','paper qualifications British English often disapproving (= documents showing that you have passed exams, rather than actual experience of doing something ) We often find that paper qualifications are no guide to ability.','a recognized qualification (= one that is accepted by people as good ) Trainees can work towards a recognised vocational qualification.','good/excellent qualifications Good qualifications are a passport to success.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He left school without any qualifications.","translation":"بدون هیچ مدرک تحصیلی ترک تحصیل کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001270.mp3"},{"sentence":"We are looking for graduates with qualifications in maths or science.","translation":"ما به دنبال فارغ التحصیلانی با مدرک ریاضی یا علوم هستیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001271.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('ce3464d5-7e93-5d80-8c65-65de43d42a01','105cd704-ddba-5fa4-863f-1f9e91048e1e',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a skill, personal quality , or type of experience that makes you suitable for a particular job or position','[ countable usually plural ]',null,'یک مهارت، کیفیت شخصی یا نوع تجربه ای که شما را برای یک شغل یا موقعیت خاص مناسب می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have a qualification ( also hold a qualification formal ) You don''t need to have any qualifications for this job.','lack qualifications 40 percent of the prisoners lack any qualifications.','get a qualification British English ( also gain/obtain a qualification formal ) I want to get the qualifications so that I can become a doctor.','academic qualifications Eva had excellent academic qualifications.','educational qualifications Too many children leave school without any educational qualifications.','a teaching/medical/legal etc qualification British English: She has a degree and a teaching qualification.','a professional qualification British English (= one relating to a professional job, such as a teacher, lawyer etc ) A professional qualification in accountancy would be an advantage.','a vocational qualification British English (= one relating to a skilled job, such as a nurse or a builder ) You can study for a vocational qualification in the tourism industry.','formal qualifications (= official qualifications rather than experience ) He has no formal qualifications.','paper qualifications British English often disapproving (= documents showing that you have passed exams, rather than actual experience of doing something ) We often find that paper qualifications are no guide to ability.','a recognized qualification (= one that is accepted by people as good ) Trainees can work towards a recognised vocational qualification.','good/excellent qualifications Good qualifications are a passport to success.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"health and fitness qualifications for membership in the Territorial Army","translation":"شرایط سلامت و تناسب اندام برای عضویت در ارتش سرزمینی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000464581.mp3"},{"sentence":"There have been questions about his qualifications to lead the company.","translation":"سوالاتی در مورد شرایط او برای رهبری شرکت وجود داشته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001569605.mp3"},{"sentence":"Does he have the right qualifications to become a Supreme Court Justice?","translation":"آیا او شرایط مناسبی برای قاضی شدن در دیوان عالی کشور دارد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001569606.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('a5d19a72-edd5-5909-9682-4e0e8e6b1b20','105cd704-ddba-5fa4-863f-1f9e91048e1e',3,null,null,'spoken & written','when a person or team reaches a necessary standard , for example by passing an examination or defeating another team','[ uncountable ]',null,'زمانی که یک فرد یا تیم به یک استاندارد ضروری می رسد، برای مثال با قبولی در امتحان یا شکست دادن تیم دیگر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have a qualification ( also hold a qualification formal ) You don''t need to have any qualifications for this job.','lack qualifications 40 percent of the prisoners lack any qualifications.','get a qualification British English ( also gain/obtain a qualification formal ) I want to get the qualifications so that I can become a doctor.','academic qualifications Eva had excellent academic qualifications.','educational qualifications Too many children leave school without any educational qualifications.','a teaching/medical/legal etc qualification British English: She has a degree and a teaching qualification.','a professional qualification British English (= one relating to a professional job, such as a teacher, lawyer etc ) A professional qualification in accountancy would be an advantage.','a vocational qualification British English (= one relating to a skilled job, such as a nurse or a builder ) You can study for a vocational qualification in the tourism industry.','formal qualifications (= official qualifications rather than experience ) He has no formal qualifications.','paper qualifications British English often disapproving (= documents showing that you have passed exams, rather than actual experience of doing something ) We often find that paper qualifications are no guide to ability.','a recognized qualification (= one that is accepted by people as good ) Trainees can work towards a recognised vocational qualification.','good/excellent qualifications Good qualifications are a passport to success.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Upon qualification, you can expect to find work abroad fairly easily.","translation":"پس از صلاحیت، می توانید انتظار داشته باشید که به راحتی کار در خارج از کشور پیدا کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000464595.mp3"},{"sentence":"the US qualification for the World Cup","translation":"راهیابی آمریکا به جام جهانی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000464596.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('929c22d3-1867-5c94-a96f-b3e144c6772e','105cd704-ddba-5fa4-863f-1f9e91048e1e',4,null,null,'spoken & written','something that you add to a statement to limit its effect or meaning','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'چیزی که به یک عبارت اضافه می کنید تا تأثیر یا معنای آن را محدود کنید',array['reservation']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have a qualification ( also hold a qualification formal ) You don''t need to have any qualifications for this job.','lack qualifications 40 percent of the prisoners lack any qualifications.','get a qualification British English ( also gain/obtain a qualification formal ) I want to get the qualifications so that I can become a doctor.','academic qualifications Eva had excellent academic qualifications.','educational qualifications Too many children leave school without any educational qualifications.','a teaching/medical/legal etc qualification British English: She has a degree and a teaching qualification.','a professional qualification British English (= one relating to a professional job, such as a teacher, lawyer etc ) A professional qualification in accountancy would be an advantage.','a vocational qualification British English (= one relating to a skilled job, such as a nurse or a builder ) You can study for a vocational qualification in the tourism industry.','formal qualifications (= official qualifications rather than experience ) He has no formal qualifications.','paper qualifications British English often disapproving (= documents showing that you have passed exams, rather than actual experience of doing something ) We often find that paper qualifications are no guide to ability.','a recognized qualification (= one that is accepted by people as good ) Trainees can work towards a recognised vocational qualification.','good/excellent qualifications Good qualifications are a passport to success.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I welcome without qualification the Minister’s proposal.","translation":"من بدون صلاحیت از پیشنهاد وزیر استقبال می کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001771177.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ab955a4b-43cd-537a-a214-cae510c81dbd','709ccd45-aa7a-5455-a740-a56fe84b5958',1,null,null,'spoken & written','in an important way or to an important degree',null,null,'به‌طور قابل‌توجه، به‌طور مهم؛ به‌طور چشمگیر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Health problems can be significantly reduced by careful diet.","translation":"مشکلات سلامتی را می توان با رژیم غذایی دقیق به میزان قابل توجهی کاهش داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000685534.mp3"},{"sentence":"Methods used by younger teachers differ significantly from those used by older ones.","translation":"روش‌هایی که معلمان جوان‌تر استفاده می‌کنند، به‌طور قابل‌توجهی با روش‌هایی که معلمان قدیمی‌تر استفاده می‌کنند، متفاوت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000685537.mp3"},{"sentence":"Delia’s work has been significantly better this year.","translation":"کار دلیا امسال بسیار بهتر بوده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000685540.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('9e20b47b-ff1e-5e87-acb2-c548d29827ed','709ccd45-aa7a-5455-a740-a56fe84b5958',2,null,null,'spoken & written','used to say that something is very important','[ sentence adverb ]',null,'میگفتن یه چیزی خیلی مهمه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The Democrats, significantly, finished well behind the Green Party.","translation":"دموکرات ها به طور قابل توجهی پس از حزب سبز به خوبی به پایان رسیدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001672783.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('177410d0-bd39-585e-95c6-98f967dcbc7e','709ccd45-aa7a-5455-a740-a56fe84b5958',3,null,null,'spoken & written','in a way that seems to have a special meaning',null,null,'به گونه ای که به نظر می رسد معنای خاصی دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"George paused, and glanced significantly in my direction.","translation":"جورج مکث کرد و نگاهی چشمگیر به سمت من انداخت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000685545.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('39dc9ecd-4d6e-5ed7-aee5-10b6d675646d','0387e0f7-fc66-599c-aa54-026bb20200ef',1,null,null,'spoken & written','knowledge about something, based on learning or experience','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'فهم، درک؛ فهم (درباره)؛ درک (بازی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have an understanding The authorities don’t seem to have a clear understanding of the problem.','gain/get/develop an understanding Scientists continued to gain a greater understanding of the effects of radiation.','deepen/broaden an understanding It is hoped that the research will broaden our understanding of the disease.','increase/improve/enhance somebody’s understanding The classes really helped to increase our understanding of the subject.','a better/greater/deeper understanding All of this will lead to a better understanding of the overseas market.','a clear understanding Before you begin, it is vital that you have a clear understanding of what you want to achieve.','a complete/thorough/full understanding The degree gives students a thorough understanding of issues relating to housing.','a proper/real understanding They lacked any real understanding of the subject.','a good understanding The sales force has a good understanding of the market.','a basic understanding The aim of the examination is to test basic understanding of the written language.','a limited understanding We have only a limited understanding of how the brain processes this information.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"How does this add to our understanding of the problem?","translation":"این چگونه به درک ما از مشکل می افزاید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943143.mp3"},{"sentence":"If you know the neighbourhood, you have an understanding of what the children are like.","translation":"اگر محله را بشناسید، درک درستی از وضعیت بچه ها دارید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943144.mp3"},{"sentence":"Linguists currently have little understanding of the exact cause of language change.","translation":"زبان شناسان در حال حاضر درک کمی از علت دقیق تغییر زبان دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943148.mp3"},{"sentence":"How can we gain an understanding of other cultures?","translation":"چگونه می توانیم درکی از فرهنگ های دیگر به دست آوریم؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943152.mp3"},{"sentence":"Over time, you will get a far better understanding of the job.","translation":"با گذشت زمان، درک بسیار بهتری از شغل خواهید داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943156.mp3"},{"sentence":"Success depends on a clear understanding of the problem.","translation":"موفقیت به درک روشن مشکل بستگی دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943162.mp3"},{"sentence":"a basic understanding of AIDS prevention","translation":"درک اساسی از پیشگیری از ایدز","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943166.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
